<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Ibaas</book>
  <para style="h">AYohana</para>
  <para style="toc3">AYoh</para>
  <para style="toc2">AYohana</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ifɛ̀ Itek naton aYeso fɛ́ AYohana Jɛk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ifɛ̀ Itek naton aYeso fɛ́</para>
  <para style="mt1">AYohana</para>
  <para style="mt2">Jɛk</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s">AYeso yet Ifɛ̀ Adakunom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Ni meseng e, Ifɛ̀ me kin di se gyam, Ifɛ̀ me kin se gung nɛ Adakunom, Ifɛ̀ me kin yet Adakunom. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />A kin se gung nɛ Adakunom neme ni imɛsɛng e. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Ni kubɔk wu fɛ́ ba kin di nye kaakyɛ. Vit ikyɛng ikak fɛ́ ba kin nye vit iwu. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Ni wu fi kutset di nes, kutset e yɔng ko ku nesek mgbɛy sak nɛ banet ngma. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Mgbɛy e rong ayɛt ahwyi, da ahwyi me kyem a irēn ina awo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ahwyi, ahwyi me kyem a fɛt mgbey e awo.</char></note>.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Adakunom kin tom na anet akak, fɛ́ ba kin ku yes aYohana. <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />A kin bɛ́ nek ishara ifɛ̀ naton mgbɛy e yɔng, nɔng banet ngma da fok ifɛ̀ me, ba di nɔɔk atsak. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Da aYohana ice wu fɛ́ a kin yet mgbɛy e awo, a kin bɛ́ tɛ anet icɛɛt afi mgbɛy kyɛk. <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Ayɔng fɛ́ a nesek mgbɛy atsak sak ne banet ngma kusum bi bɛ́ azatse.<verse eid="JHN 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Iwu kin se na azatse neme, ayet fok ba kin nye kaakyɛ ni kubɔk wu, ngma nɛ anɔng, kazatse me nɛ ka ku rēn awo. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />A bɛ́ sak na bayɔng fɛ́ ba yet bafuu, wɛt bafuu me raba dan ku shan. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Ngma nɛ nɔng, ngma bayɔng fɛ́ ba ku shan, bayɔng fɛ́ ba di nɔɔk atsak ni iyerek wu, a mi ka ba nɔk ízɔk nɛ ba sot nnon Adakunom, <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />da kuri nnon fɛ́ na nes ni irɔm awo, da na yɔng fɛ́ ba sɛs nek imoon irɔm amatek nɛ abining awo, tit na yɔng fɛ́ Adakunom wu a nesek.<verse eid="JHN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Ifɛ̀ me sot anet, a sot azeng azatse ngma ni yit. Iyit mi di yit ízɔk wu, ízɔk atutup Nggon e yɔng fɛ́ ka ne narɔ Ada me, a yɔng fɛ́ a mi ki tonong yit itek wu, nɛ angmishish wu, fi in di ki te yit iyɛ.<verse eid="JHN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />AYohana cɛɛt naton wu. A fɛrɛng nɛ agap yɛ, &lt;&lt;Iwu me yɔng fi in kin fɛ̀ ni yin yɛ, &lt;Ayɔng fɛ́ a bi bɛ́ ama min di wat ni iratek, nek iwu kin di se neme dan ba di tes.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Nek kudot itek nɛ angmishish wu, fi in mi sɛs yit fi in di barasa kashon sak kashon. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Nek ntsi kin ne ni bɔk aMusa; wɛt ishim nɛ atsak, ne ni bɔk aYeso Kristi yit. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Vit anet fɛ́ a kumang di Adakunom. Tit azizɛɛt nggon wu me yɔng, fɛ́ ka se nagbɔng nɛ Adakunom, fɛ́ a se ni kufam Ada me, fɛ́ a mi ki tonong yit nse Ada me weshek.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYohana fɛ̀ da iwu wu ayet Anet-Isheshek e awo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Kucɛɛt ka fɛ́ aYohana kin nye, ni izen fɛ́ bakɔk-ashon baYahuda fɛ́ ba se ne aRushelima kin tom banet izit aLawi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Banet izit aLawi.</char></note> nɛ áware, na ba tsɛ ba ku rip, fok iwu yet angan ɛ. <verse eid="JHN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />A ka ba nɛt ikikak awo, a fɛ̀ ni ba yɛ, &lt;&lt;Imi wu in yet Anet-Isheshek e awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Ba ku rip yɛ, &lt;&lt;Awɛt ngɔn yet angan e yɛ? Ke ngɔn yet aIliya yɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">A fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Awɛy, imi yet wu awo.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Ba tɛ ba ku rip fok, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn yet Atan e yɔng ɛ?&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Iyɛrɛk Ntsi 18:15</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 18:18">18</ref></char>.</note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">A fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Awɛy.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Ni gang e, ba ku rip fok, &lt;&lt;Awɛt ngɔn yet angan e yɛ? Ki tak yit, nɔng in da sɛ yit ikyɛng fi in da tsin tak yit bayɔng fɛ́ ba ki tom yit. Akyɛ fi ngɔn da ki tak yit naton ice ngɔn ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />AYohana ka ba nɔɔk kanu ifɛ̀ kpaf ni ikyɛng fɛ́ àware aIshaya kin mang jɛk yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:23">&lt;&lt;Imi wu in yet kutɔ fi ku dɛrɛ ayit,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 1:23">Nye yin irèn tsik</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 1:23">nek ku bɛ́ Adakunom!&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">AIshaya 40:3</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Ama anɔng, bayɔng fɛ́ BaFarasi ka ba tom e <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />ku rip yɛ, &lt;&lt;Ki da ngɔn wu fi iyet Anet-Isheshek me awo, da ngɔn yet aIliya awo, da ngɔn yet Atan e yɔng awo, akyɛ sak fi i tsin ras banet abatisma yɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />AYohana fɛ̀ ni ba yɛ, &lt;&lt;Imi ki ras in abatisma ne ashi, wɛt azeng nate yin, akak di se fi da iyin ku rēn yin awo. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />Iwu me yɔng fɛ́ ngmash na a tumung kutomong wu, imi kyem fi in da bisik kudun ikpatak wu awo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Nkyɔrɔk e nang ngma ba kin ra ina na aBetani, kaban wɔp fɛ́ ka se ni bɔk imen kukyɛk aJodan karɔ fɛ́ aYohana di ras abatisma.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso yet <optbreak /> Kitsamang Adakunom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Akatson, aYohana di aYeso tseng sak ibɛ narɔ wu, ama fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Di yin! Kitsamang Adakunom, ka yɔng fɛ́ ka fuut inɛn azatse! <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Iwu fi in tsin di cɛɛt fok, &lt;Anet fɛ́ a da bɛ́ ama min e, di wat ni iratek, nek iwu se kashon ni imi.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Imi ice min tsang ku rēn awo, nek anɔng wu fi in tsin di ras abatisma ne ashi, nɔng in da ku tonong mo sak nɛ banet aIsrela.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />AYohana ma fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;In di Kabik aJɛrɛ tik tɛ abɔp, ka di nak naton wu. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Zɔng ki imi kyem in rēn fok iwu yɔng awo, wɛt ayɔng fɛ́ di tom ni in ra abatisma ne ashi, iwu fɛ̀ ni mi, &lt;Ayɔng fi ngɔn di Kabik aJɛrɛ di tik naton wu tɛ abɔp, ka di nak, iwu me yɔng fɛ́ a ras abatisma ne Kabik aJɛrɛ.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Imi di ikyɛng e te kpaf anɔng, nek anɔng fi in di fɛ̀, Arim Adakunom e yong.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bafi imɛɛs imɛsɛng e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Akatson, aYohana se ni nyeseng azɔng nɛ bafi imɛɛs wu bafaa. <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />Ni izen fɛ́ a di aYeso tsin got, aYohana ku yɛrɛk, a da fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Di yin Kitsamang Adakunom!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Ni izen fɛ́ bafi imɛɛs aYohana bafaa me fok anɔng, ba tirik ba kpa di kuus aYeso.<verse eid="JHN 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />AYeso tirik a ka ba di ba tsin ku kuus mo, a kaba rip yɛ, &lt;&lt;Akyɛ fi itsɛt yin ɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:38">Ba fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;ARabay&gt;&gt; (fi isonong naton Anet Itees), &lt;&lt;ngɔn tik akɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />A fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;Di kuus yin mo da tsi di yin.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:39">Nek anɔng, ba ku kuus mo, ba tsɛ ba di karɔ fɛ́ a di se, ba woso gung ni iwu azɔng. Itsɔm inaas ifɛ́ awuri kin tsang nye.<verse eid="JHN 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Andarawus, arunyining aSiman Bitrus kin yet azining ayɛt bayɔng fɛ́ ba kin fok ifɛ̀ aYohana ba di kuus aYeso me. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Ikyɛng imɛsɛng e fɛ́ Andarawus kin nye yet, a tsɛ tsɛt arunyining aSiman, a fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;In mi sɛ yit Anet-Isheshek e.&gt;&gt; (Fi isonong naton aKristi.)<verse eid="JHN 1:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Andarawus ma sok aSiman sak narɔ aYeso. Ama fɛ́ aYeso di te ayisi gbiit na aSiman, a fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn yet aSiman arim aYohana, ba da ka yes aKefas.&gt;&gt; (Fi isonong naton aBitrus kɛ kuta ayi.)<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Akatson, aYeso te iyɛ i tse sak nɛ aGalili. A sɛ aFilibus, a da ma fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Bɛ́ di kuus mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />AFilibus yet anet iwɔp aBatseyida, kuwɔp fɛ́ Andarawus, nɛ aBitrus di ne.<verse eid="JHN 1:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />AFilibus wat a di berem a tsɛ a tsɛt aNataniyel a da fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;In mi sɛ yit anet e ayɔng fɛ́ aMusa nɛ áware kin di jɛk naton wu! Iyerek wu yet aYeso, nggon aYusufu anet aNazaret.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />ANataniyel fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;ANazaret a! Ikyɛng kak itek da kyem ine nɛ aNazaret a?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:46">AFilibus fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn bit kyɛk i da tsi i di nɛ ayisi ngɔn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Izen fɛ́ aYeso di aNataniyel tsɛ wuruk, a fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Anet atsak yong a tsɛ a wuruk, atutup kutes aIsrela.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />ANataniyel ku nye irip yɛ, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn tsa nɛ fi i di rēn ɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:48">AYeso fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Neeme ni ngɔn resek ni tin atafo, dan aFilibus na tsɛ a da sɛ, imi ma na in da di.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />ANataniyel fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Anet Itees, ngɔn yet Arim Adakunom, agwɔm aIsrela!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn wat i nɔɔk atsak ngma nek imi fɛ̀ ni ngɔn, in mi da di ni tin atafo yɛ? I da di agbat ntomong fi nnat nnang.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />A ban fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Atsak e yet ngma yin i bi di yin kazanɛn ni itarak, nɛ batomaza Adakunom tisik nɛ ba ngarak ni ce Arim Anet.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s">Kuweneng nɛ aKana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Ni kunom kufɛ́ ataat, ba kin ra kuweneng ne kaban wɔp aKana nɛ aGalili, nggɔ aYeso kin se azɔng. <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />Ba kin rini aYeso nɛ bafi imɛɛs wu, sak narɔ iweneng e bà. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Ni izen fɛ́ ashi anap bɛ́ a gang, nggɔ aYeso tsɛ fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Ashi anap ba mi gang.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Aneng, inaan yet akyɛ ayet e yɛ, Izen hom resek.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Nggɔ wu fɛ̀ nɛ banet itomong e, &lt;&lt;Nye yin ngma ikyɛng fɛ́ a fɛ̀ ni yin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Ányin ábush karataat afɛ ata kin se bakat azɔng; fɛ́ baYahuda di kus nkap kpaf ti nggɔn ba di se, kaakyi kubush kuzining ya ítsɛ́n-imaas nsɔk nfaa sak ntaat. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />AYeso fɛ̀ ne bafi itomong e, &lt;&lt;Shining yin ábush e nɛ ashi.&gt;&gt; Ama fɛ́ ba shining ábush e nɛ ashi me nyif, <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />a fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;Bɔ yin gyeet, tsi nɔɔk yin akɔk-ashon kuro iweneng e.&gt;&gt; Ba nye kpaf anɔng.<verse eid="JHN 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />Izen fɛ́ akɔk-ashon kuro iweneng e fubuk ashi fɛ́ a mi sot ashi anap e, ni wu dan rēn karɔ fɛ́ ba di ne ni ina. Nkum basam e kyɛk fɛ́ ba irēn, nek anɔng, a yes amatek agwol e.<verse eid="JHN 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />A fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Amatek agwol tin nesek ashi anap atek ni imɛsɛng e, ama fɛ́ kaangan mi sɔ a ku kyem, na nɛ na bene nɛ ayɔng fɛ́ da amak ta awo ni gang e anɛ, wɛt ngɔn tsi sak atek e, ni turung ina yɔkɔnɔng ɛ!&gt;&gt;<figure style="fig" alt="Wedding at Cana" file="WA03814b.tif" size="col" loc="JHN 2:5" copy="Wade Images" ref="2:1-10">Kuweneng ne aKana</figure><verse eid="JHN 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Kutomong abes kang fɛ́ aYeso kin ra nɛ aKana afɛ́ aGalili, iko ko ku yet kutomong abes imɛsɛng wu, bafi imɛɛs wu nɔɔk atsak ni iwu.<verse eid="JHN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Ama kuweneng e, a tseng sak nɛ aKafarnahum a tse nye nkɔs nfa nɛ nggɔ wu, nɛ barunyining, nɛ bafi imɛɛs wu.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso hwyɛrɛng banet narɔ iya Adakunom ntong</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Ni izen fi kunom amok iyiring na aPasova baYahuda (kunom fɛ́ atomaza kin shorosho nasa nnon aIsrela na aMasat) bɛ́ bakat, aYeso tseng sak nɛ aRushelima. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />A tsɛ sɛ bafi ijik atasa arɔ iya Adakunom ntong, na ba tsin rɛɛs inyak, ni ibon, nɛ abɔp, nɛ bakak ni sosok na ákon ishesheng itsɔm bá. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Nek anɔng, aYeso bat ahwyereng itsam, a kpa ka ba zim mo pet sak amatse katasa arɔ iya Adakunom ntong e, pet ni inyak ni ibon, a shik ica itsɔm bafi ishesheng e, nɛ nye gup ákon bá me. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />A fɛ̀ na bafi irɛɛs abɔp, &lt;&lt;Turung yin nkyɔrɔk nang azeng! Akyɛ sak fi i da tirik yin kari Ada min na ka sot karɔ ijik ɛ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Bafi imɛɛs wu wat ba yiring fok i se ni jɛk: &lt;&lt;Ifup ari ngɔn bi di ya iyɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Bágwɔm ntsi baYahuda ku nye irip yɛ, &lt;&lt;Akyɛ kuri kutomong abes fi ngɔn da ki nye yit ɛ fi ku da ki tonong yit fok ngɔn kyem ni inye ikyɛng deng ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;Fo yin Kutu iya Adakunom Ntong kang, imi da ti in donong iko ayɛt nnom ntaat.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />BaYahuda shim, &lt;&lt;Akyɛ! Ba sok ayɛ nsɔk nnaas ne karataat ba di nok Kutu iya Adakunom Ntong kang, ngɔn da bi fɛ̀ fok i da donong iko ayɛt nnom ntaat a?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Kutu iya Adakunom ntong fɛ́ aYeso tsin cɛɛt naton ko yet kurɔm wu. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Ama fɛ́ ba ku donong ni irɛk, bafi imɛɛs wu nɛ ba yiring fok a kin mang fɛrɛng anɔng. Ba di nɔɔk atsak na aYeso ni Ifɛ̀ Adakunom.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Ni wu mo azɔng nɛ aRushelima nek amok aPasova, banet dot di ntomong abes fɛ́ a ras, ba di nɔɔk atsak ni iyerek wu. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Ngma nɛ anɔng, aYeso di te iyɛ ni ba awo, nek iwu rēn nse ba ngma. <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />Da iwu tsɛt akak fɛ́ a da ku tak nse anet awo, nek iwu rēn nse banet.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s">AYeso nɛ aNikodimos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Atuk akak nɛ wuwuri, karɔ mi te hwyi, akɔk-ashon baYahuda akak fi iyerek wu kin yet aNikodimos, a kin yet azining ayɛt BaFarasi. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />A tsɛ sɛ aYeso natuk a da ma ku rip, yɛ, &lt;&lt;Anet Itees, ngma yit in rēn yit fok ngɔn yet Anet Itees fɛ́ Adakunom wu a da tom. Nek vit ayɔng fɛ́ a da kyem ne a raas ntomong abes yɔng fi ngɔn tsin raas e, kɛ da Adakunom se gung ni wu awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Atsak atsitsak, vit anet fɛ́ a da kyem a nɔ ayɛt Igwɔm Adakunom, i se gbing-gbing ma ba tɛ ba ku tes ninyɛn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />ANikodimos tɛ ban ku nye irip, yɛ, &lt;&lt;Ba da tsa anɛ fɛ́ ba da tɛ ba tes anet fɛ́ a mi kop ɛ, a da tɛ nɔ nafa anyining nɔng ba da tɛ ba ku tes ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Won in da tak atsak, vit ayɔng fɛ́ a da kyem a nɔ ayɛt igwɔm Adakunom dang nɛ ba ku tes nɛ ashi nɛ Kabik. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Anet kyem a tes anet kyɛk, wɛt ikyɛng fɛ́ Kabik tes yet kabik. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />A bi da te yɔɔt nek ikyɛng fi in fɛ̀ awo, yɛ, &lt;Ma ba tɛ ba ki tes yin ninyɛn awo.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Kyon ti fi kuwun di fɛsɛm sak abak arɔ fi kushim; idɔng i se kpaf anɔng nɛ ayɔng fɛ́ Kabik tes.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />ANikodimos ban ku rip, yɛ, &lt;&lt;Na anɛ fi i da sot anɔng ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn yet agbat anet itees ntsi bafi aIsrela, wɛt ni ngɔn gaat irēn ikyɛng deng ɛ? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Won in da tak atsak, iyit cɛɛt yit ikyɛng fi in rēn yit, in taas yit ikyɛng fi in man di yit, ngma nɛ anɔng, ni iyin ra yin dang di nɔɔk yin atsak ni ifɛ̀ yit. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Ki in cɛɛt naton nkyɔrɔk azatse nang ni ra yin dang nɔɔk yin atsak, nɛ anɛ fi i da kyem i nɔɔk yin atsak ki in ki tak yin ifɛ̀ azanɛn ɛ? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Vit ayɔng fɛ́ a kin man tsɛ azanɛn, tit azining e yɔng fɛ́ a ne azanɛn, Arim Anet. <verse eid="JHN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />Kpaf tɛ fɛ́ aMusa kin di nabak ihwyen ayet ayit, anɔng wu fi i se gbing-gbing ba bi nabak Arim Anet. <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />Nɔng ngma bayɔng fɛ́ ba nɔɔk atsak ni wu, ba bi sɛ kutset vit igang.<verse eid="JHN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />&lt;&lt;Nek ishim fɛ́ Adakunom bɛ́ nek kazatse makiyi, a nɔɔk azizɛɛt ari wu, nɔng ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a nɔɔk atsak ni wu, a da wey awo, tit a da sɛ kutset vit igang. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Da Adakunom tom Ari wu sak azatse nɔng a da ra kazatse ishɔt awo, tit nek kazatse ka di sɛ isheshek ni bɔk wu.<verse eid="JHN 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />&lt;&lt;Bayɔng fɛ́ ba nɔɔk atsak ni wu, vit ishɔt naton ba, awɛt bayɔng fɛ́ ba raba dan nɔɔk atsak ni wu, ishɔt me ka ba ya gyam nek ba raba dan nɔɔk atsak ni iyerek atutup arim Adakunom. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Ishɔt ka ba ya nek: mgbɛy ne naton, in bɛ́ azatse, wɛt banet wat ishim nhwyi aza mgbey nek nggɔn bá yet nman e. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a raas aduk nggɔn, da a shim mgbɛy awo, a shim a bɛ́ bakat ni mgbɛy awo, kɔng ba bi di ikyɛng fɛ́ a se ne. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Awɛt ayɔng fɛ́ a raas atsak, ayɔng nɔɔs ayɛt mgbɛy, nɔng kaangan bin di weshek fok ikyɛng fɛ́ a se ne, Adakunom wu a tsin ku sɛ mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYohana anet abatisma nɔɔk aYeso iratek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Ama anɔng, aYeso nɛ bafi imɛɛs wu, ba tseng sak ni mben aJudiya, a tsɛ sok izen azɔng ni iba, nɛ ba raas abatisma.<verse eid="JHN 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Ni izen e yɔng, ne aYohana se ni raas abatisma nɛ Anon bakat nɛ aSalim, nek karɔ me kin bɛ̀ ashi dot, banet woso tang kudang sak azɔng, nɔng ba da ka ba ra abatisma. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />(Ikyɛng e deng kin te nɛ ba resek dan te kpaf aYohana ari inyang.) <verse eid="JHN 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Ni izen e yɔng, bafi imɛɛs aYohana kpa nanan nɛ anet aYahuda akak, naton nggɔn ikusu. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Bafi imɛɛs e tsɛ ba sɛ aYohana ba fɛ̀ ni wu, yɛ, &lt;&lt;Anet Itees, anet yame fi in kin ku sɛ yit ni nyi kukyɛk aJodan, ayɔng fi ngɔn kin fɛ̀ fok ayet Anet-Isheshek yit, a yɔng a se ni ras abatisma bà. Banet yɔng ba tang kudang sak azɔng, ba raba dan bɛs azeng narɔ yit.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />AYohana fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;Vit anet fɛ́ a da kyem a sɛ ikikak, tit Adakunom wu a ku nɔk. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Iyin ice yin rēn yin fok, in man ki tak yin, yɛ, &lt;Da imi wu in yet Anet-Isheshek e awo, tit ayɔng fɛ́ ba tom e, fi in tsin ku nye irèn.&gt; <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Ni weneng, amatek agwol e wu a sok agwol e. Ifɛ́ afidang wu yet na a ku sɛ mo itɛrɛk iyɛ kyɛk, nek anɔng, iyɛ ikan in, mi shining nek iwu. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />I se gbing-gbing iwu nɛ a ya kashon ni i rasak, ni imi ban kyɛɛs.<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />&lt;&lt;Ayɔng fɛ́ a ne azanɛn, a wat akaangan. Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a ne azatse, a yet a fɛ́ azatse, kucɛɛt wu yet kufe azatse. Ayɔng fɛ́ a ne azanɛn wat akaangan. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />Iwu cɛɛt naton ikyɛng fɛ́ a kin man di, ni idɔng fɛ́ a kin man fok, ngma nɛ anɔng vit ayɔng fɛ́ a shan ifɛ̀ wu. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a shan kucɛɛt wu, a mi tonong weshek, yɛ, Adakunom yet atsak. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Nek ayɔng fɛ́ Adakunom tom e, a cɛɛt kucɛɛt Adakunom, nek Adakunom ku nesek Kabik vit nkum. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Ada me shim ari me, nek anɔng, a nɔɔk kaakyɛ ni bɔk wu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 11:27">AMatiyu 11:27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:22">ALuka 10:22</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a nɔɔk atsak ni ari me, a bɛ̀ kutset vit igang. Awɛt ayɔng fɛ́ a rawu ari me, vit iwu ni sɛ kutset, tit ishɔt Adakunom fi ikyɛk naton wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s">AYeso cɛɛt nɛ anya aSamariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />BaFarasi sɛ kurēn fok yɛ, aYeso mi kpa sɛs banet abatisma fɛ́ ba wat bafɛ́ aYohana, <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />(atsak e yet fok da a yet aYeso ice wu fɛ́ a ka ba ras abatisma awo, ayet bafi imɛɛs wu ba ba ras.) <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />Izen fɛ aTisa fok anɔng, a won mben aJudiya sak ibun nɛ aGalili.<verse eid="JHN 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />I se gbing-gbing nɛ got nate aSamariya sak azɔng. <verse eid="JHN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Ayɛt anɔng a tsɛ ta naban wɔp aSamariya fɛ́ ba yes ika aSika, ka se bakat ni ikɔ dɔng fɛ́ aYakub kin nɔɔk ari wu aYusufu. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Ibong ashi aYakub kin se azɔng, aYeso tse sonong ni fam de nek irɔɔn kutseet, izen e kin se bakat, ka te inom.<verse eid="JHN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Ni izen fɛ́ anya aSamariya akak tse, a tsɛ tok ashi, aYeso fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Di nang ashi in sɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />(Bafi imɛɛs wu mi tsang tseng sak ayɛt iwɔp nek ishan nayak.)<verse eid="JHN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Anya aSamariya me fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn yet anet aYahuda, imi yet anya aSamariya. Akyɛ te fi ngɔn di rip ashi isɔ yɛ?&gt;&gt; (Nek vit ikyɛng fi imoon baYahuda nɛ bafɛ́ aSamariya.)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Da ba sɔ na tsereng kazining awo.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Ki ngɔn fi rēn kunang Adakunom, nɛ anet fɛ́ a da rip ashi me, ki ngɔn fɛ̀ ni wu, yɛ na da nang ashi fɛ́ a nesek kutset.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Abining e fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Akɔk-ashon, vit ngɔn ni ikyɛng ibɔ ashi me, di kutsik ibong e, i da tsa nɛ fi i da sɛ ashi kutset e yɛ? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Ngɔn wat adakop yit aYakub fɛ́ a kin ki won yit ibong ashi deng, fi iwu ice wu, ni nnon wu, ni nkpara wu kin sɔ ina ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a sɔ ashi nang, a tɛ a foos iyɛ ngash, <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a sɔ ashi me yɔng, fi imi da ku nɔk, a bi tɛ a fok iyɛ ngash awo. Nek ashi fi in da ku nɔk e, a da sot itis ashi ayɛɛt wu, fɛ́ a da ku nesek ashi kutset vit igang.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Abining e wat a fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Kabɔk akɔk-ashon, di nang kuri ashi me yɔng, nɔng in bi tin fok iyɛ ngash awo, nɔng in da fɔɔn ni bɛs azeng, nek itos ashi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Tseng tsi di yɛs amatek ngɔn, nɔng i da bɛ́ yin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Abining e fɛ̀ nɛ aYeso, &lt;&lt;Imi da in bɛ̀ amatek awo.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:17">AYeso fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn tak katsak! Ngɔn da i bɛ̀ amatek awo. <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />Katsak e yet fok, ngɔn mi sosok nɛ batek batoon, ngma nɛ ayɔng fi i se gung ni iwu yɔkɔnɔng da a yet amatek ngɔn awo. Kucɛɛt ngɔn yet atutup atsak.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Abining e fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Akɔk-ashon, imi di ti ngɔn yet àware. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Badakop yit ya ntong ni ihwyanang e, ni iyin baYahuda nye yin yɛ karɔ fi i se gbing-gbing ba di ya ntong yet aRushelima.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Anyin ari, nɔk atsak ni ifɛ̀ min, izen bi nye, fɛ́ vit ayɔng fɛ́ a bi ya Adakunom ntong azeng kɛ nɛ aRushelima awo ayi. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Iyin bafɛ́ aSamariya da i rēn yin ayɔng fi i ku ya yin ntong awo. Iyit ba in rēn yit ayɔng fi in ku ya yit ntong, nek isheshek ne narɔ baYahuda. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Ngma nɛ anɔng, izen bi nye, iyeng imi nye, fɛ́ bafi iya Adakunom ntong nɛ atsak, bi ya Ada me ntong ayɛt abik, nɛ atsak. Nek kuri bafi iya ntong fɛ Ada tsɛt yɔng. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Adakunom yet kabik, i se gbing-gbing bayɔng fɛ́ ba da ku ya ntong, nɛ ba ku ya ntong ayɛt abik, nɛ atsak.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Abining e fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Imi rēn fok Anet-Isheshek e fɛ́ ba ku yes &lt;AKristi&gt; bi bɛ́. Izen fɛ́ a bɛ́, a bi ki tees yit kaakyi ikyɛng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />AYeso ma fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Imi fi in tsin cɛɛt ni ngɔn yet iwu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Ba se ni kucɛɛt, bafi imɛɛs wu bɛs ba. Ayɔɔt ka ba yit fɛ́ ba ku sɛ na tsin cɛɛt nɛ abining e, awɛt vit akak ba fɛ̀ a nɛ a kyem a ngamang kanu a ku rip mo, ikyɛng fɛ́ ba se ni icɛɛt e. <verse eid="JHN 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Abining e won kuwang ashi wu bakat ni ibong ashi me, a tɛ bun sak ne ban wɔp e, a tsɛ tak banet ifɛ̀ me, yɛ, <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />&lt;&lt;Bit, tsi di yin anet fɛ́ a mi di tak ngma ikyɛng fi in ki mang ra, ke iwu wu ayet Anet-Isheshek me ayi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Banet iwɔp e yit irèn sak narɔ aYeso.<verse eid="JHN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Ni izen e yɔng, bafi imɛɛs wu fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;ARabay, te ikikak na nu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />A fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;Imi bɛ̀ nayak iya fɛ́ da iyin rēn yin ikikak naton na awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Bafi imɛɛs wu me kpa kana risim, &lt;&lt;Ke akak mi bɛ́ a ku nɔk ikyɛng iya yɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />AYeso ma fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;Kuyak yin yet ni in ra kushim ayɔng fɛ́ a di tom, sak igang e. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Iyin nye yin yɛ, &lt;Ishɛrɛp mo nfen nnaas ishamang ni nye&gt; anɛ? Won in ki tak yin, tarak yin ayisi, i da di yin akɔ! A mi ben ishɛrɛp itusung e. <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Yɔkɔnɔng ana, afi itusung e tsin shashang izang wu, a se ni tusung kuyak e, sak i sɛ kutset vit igang, nɔng afi ituus e, nɛ afi itusung e, da bin nye iyɛ ikan ngma bà. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Kpaf ti itin ifɛ̀ de, &lt;Akak tuus, akak itusung.&gt; Ifɛ̀ me yet atsak. <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Imi ki tom yin ni tsi itusung yin ikyɛng fi da iyin mi sɔ yin isam naton e awo. Bakak mi sɔ isam e, iyin nɔng imi tusung yin izang mgbang ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Banet aSamariya dot nɔɔk atsak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Banet aSamariya dot bafi iwɔp e yɔng, nɔɔk atsak nɛ aYeso nek ikyɛng fɛ́ abining e fɛ̀ ni ba yɛ, &lt;&lt;A di tak ngma ikyɛng fi in ki mang ra!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Izen fɛ́ bafɛ́ aSamariya me tsɛ ba ku sɛ, ba tsot akabɔk ni wu yɛ nɛ a ban sot ni ba, a ban te nkɔs nfaa azɔng. <verse eid="JHN 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Nek ifɛ̀ wu, banet dot ban di nɔɔk atsak. <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />Ba fɛ̀ nɛ abining e, &lt;&lt;Yɔkɔnɔng, iyit mi nɔɔk yit atsak, da nek ikyɛng fi ngɔn ki tak yit kyɛk awo, ayet nek ikyɛng fi iyit mi fok yit ice yit, iyit mi rēn, yit ye anet yong, yet atutup Anet-Isheshek azatse.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso te nggon anet itomong igwɔm kyang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Ama nkɔs nfaa me azɔng, aYeso won mben aSamariya sak nɛ aGalili. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />(AYeso ice wu a ki mang tonong wɛshɛk fok yɛ, àware bɛ̀ iratek ni wɔp fɛ́ a di ne awo.) <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Ni izen fɛ́ a tsɛ a ta nɛ aGalili, banet aGalili me ku te show ni ku bɛ́, nek iba kin di ikyɛng fi i kin te azɔng nɛ aRushelima ni izen amok aPasova, nek iba kin se azɔng bà.<verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />AYeso tɛ tsɛ nɛ aKana afɛ́ aGalili, narɔ fɛ́ a kin di tirik ashi sak ashi anap. Azɔng, anet itomong igwɔm akak kin di se fi nggon wu kin se na meneng ni rɔk nɛ aKafarnahum. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Ni izen fɛ́ anet e fok yɛ, aYeso mi won mben aJudiya, a mi bɛ́ ta ni mben aGalili, a tsɛ narɔ aYeso, a ku tsot akabɔk fok yɛ, na ku a ku kuus mo sak nɛ aKafarnahum, a da bin tsɛ a te ari wu kyang.<verse eid="JHN 4:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Ki da iyin di yin ikyɛng ayɔɔt, ni ntomong abes ninyɛn awo, i da nɔɔk yin atsak awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Anet itomong igwɔm e, fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Kabɔk atekari, bit ziri kɔn nggon yin bi ku.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Tseng sak ari. Nggon ngɔn da te kyang.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:50">Anet e nɔɔk atsak ni ifɛ̀ aYeso, a yit irèn sak ari. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Ni wu resek mo dan ta ari, a wat a nyim nɛ basam wu ni irèn, ba ku tak fok ari wu mi te kyang. <verse eid="JHN 4:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />A ka ba rip izen fi nggon e kpa sɛs kukyang, ba fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Ifes e ku won ni ire, bakat itsɔm izining ifi inom.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 4:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Ada me wat a rēn, fok kpaf izen e yɔng fɛ́ aYeso fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Nggon ngɔn da te kyang.&gt;&gt; Nek anɔng, ngma banet ari wu nɔɔk atsak nɛ aYeso.<verse eid="JHN 4:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Kutomong abes kang kin yet kufe afaa, fɛ́ aYeso kin ra nɛ aGalili, ama fɛ́ a ne na aJudiya.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s">AYeso te akun akak kyang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Ama anɔng, aYeso tseng sak nɛ aRushelima nek amok akak afɛ́ baYahuda. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Azɔng ayɛt iwɔp aRushelima, bakat ne katisi ibón, kudúng ashi kukak, se azɔng fɛ́ ba yes iko ni ilem Aram ye, aBetesda, kudúng e bɛ̀ narɔ inɔs natoon. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Azɔng fɛ́ banet nrɔk zizɛɛt di sosok; bakpatong, nɛ bakun, nɛ bayɔng fi nrɔm man sɔrɔk.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Afumung akak fɛ́ ba kin jɛk ni mbɔk di barang </char><char style="fv">4</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Bayɔng fi nrɔm man sɔrɔk ba kin se ni itot izen fɛ́ atomaza da su ashi me.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Anet akak azining azɔng, mi sok ayɛ nsɔk ntaat ina nkara (38) ne bɔrɔng ni kurɔm. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Izen fɛ́ aYeso ku di nɛ meneng azɔng, ni iwu mi rēn kudot izen fɛ́ anet e mi sok nɛ bɔrɔng ni kurɔm e, aYeso fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn shim a da te kyang ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Anet irɔk e fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Akɔk-ashon, vit imi nɛ anet fɛ́ a di ki sɛ mo, a di sɔɔn sak ayɛt ashi me. Izen fi in da fi in te nyɛk in tsin nɔ, nɛ kak tin nɔ ashon yin.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Dorok tsik, sok kushit ngɔn, da yit irèn!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Ni izen izining, anet e wat a sɛ kukyang; a sok kushit wu, a tseng.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Kunom e yɔng, fi ikyɛng deng kin te, kin yet kunom aSabat (kunom ifɔɔn baYahuda). <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />Nek anɔng, bágwɔm ntsi baYahuda fɛ̀ nɛ anet fɛ́ ba ku te kyang e, &lt;&lt;Atut yet aSabat; ntsi fɛ̀, da i bi sok kushit ngɔn awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Awɛt anet e fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Anet e yɔng fɛ́ a di te kyang, iwu wu fɛ́ a fɛ̀ ni mi, &lt;Sok kushit ngɔn, da tseng.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Ba fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Angan yɔng a yet ayɔng, fɛ́ a fɛ̀ ni ngɔn yɛ ni sok iko, i da tseng ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Anet fɛ́ ba ku te kyang e, da a nɛ rēn anet fɛ́ a ku te kyang e awo, nek aYeso mi tsang nɔ, ayɛt banet.<verse eid="JHN 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Ama izen ikak, aYeso ku sɛ narɔ iya Adakunom ntong, a fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Di, fi ngɔn mi te kyang. Won iras inɛn, kɔn ikyɛng fi igot ideng imaan e, bi ti i da sɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Anet e ma tsɛ tsɛt bágwɔm ntsi baYahuda me, a fɛ̀ ni ba, yɛ, aYeso wu fɛ́ a kin ku te kyang.<verse eid="JHN 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutset fɛ́ ba sɛs ayɛt nggɔn e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Nek aYeso raas ntomong nang atuk aSabat, bágwɔm ntsi baYahuda ku te ashon. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Ada min ren se ni kutomong sak atut, nek anɔng fi imi tsin di ra me bà.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Nek anɔng wu, fɛ́ bágwɔm ntsi baYahuda ba ban tsɛt ice fɛ́ ba da ku fɛt mo; ba fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Da a beseng ntsi kunom ifɔɔn kyɛk kong awo, a yɔng a nye yɛ Adakunom yet Ada wu, nɛ tes ice wu nagbɔng nɛ Adakunom.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />AYeso tɛ a fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Won in ki tak yin atsak, nggon e kyem ka nye ikikak i fi ice ka awo, tit ikyɛng fɛ́ ka di Atek tsin ras e, nek ngma ikyɛng fɛ́ Ada me ras, ide de Ari me ras. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Nek Ada me shim Ari me, a ku tonoso ngma ikyɛng fɛ́ a ras. A da ku tonoso nkyɔrɔk fi in wat nnang fi in da ki te yin kpɔrɔk. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Nek kpaf anɔng fɛ́ Ada me di donoso bafaben, nɛ ka ba nesek kutset, kpaf anɔng fɛ́ Ari me di nesek kutset sak nɛ ayɔng fi iyɛ wu shim. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Ama anɔng, da Atek e ra akak ishɔt awo, a mi nɔɔk Ari me kukyem ira kaakyɛ ishɔt, <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />nɔng kaangan bin nɔɔk Ari me iratek, kpaf tɛ fɛ́ ba di nesek Ada me. Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a rawu dan nesek Ari me iratek, a rawu dan nesek Ada me yɔng fɛ́ a ku tom iratek.<verse eid="JHN 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />&lt;&lt;In ki tak yin atsak, ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a foos ifɛ̀ hom, na nesek atsak ne ayɔng fɛ́ a di tom, a bɛ̀ kutset vit igang. Ba bi ku ra ishɔt awo; a mi shorop iku, sak isɛ kutset. <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />In tsin ki tak yin atsak, izen bi bɛ́, iyeng i mi nye, fɛ bafaben da fok kutɔ Arim Adakunom, bayɔng fɛ́ ba fok da sɛ kutset. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Kpaf tɛ fɛ́ Ada me di nesek kutset, anɔng fɛ́ a mi nɔɔk Ari wu kukyem inesek kutset bà. <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />A mi ku nɔk ice ira ishɔt azatse kusum, nek iwu yet Arim Anet.<verse eid="JHN 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />&lt;&lt;Ayɔɔt bi ki yit yin nek ideng awo, nek izen bi nye fɛ́ ngma bayɔng fɛ́ ba bi se ayɛt arɛk, ba bi fok kutɔ wu <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />yɔng ba bi wuru, bayɔng fɛ́ ba nye itek, ba bi doro bafaben sak i sɛ kutset, nɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba kin ra imaan e, ba bi doro bafaben sak ni ishɔt. <verse eid="JHN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />Imi bɛ̀ agap ira ikyɛng ikak azimin awo; imi raas ishɔt kpaf ti in di foos, ishɔt yin yet ifɛ́ atsak, nek in raas kushim ice min awo, tit ifɛ́ ayɔng fɛ́ a di tom.<verse eid="JHN 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kucɛɛt fɛ́ ba nye naton aYeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />&lt;&lt;Wo imi fi ncɛɛt naton ice min kyɛk, ki kucɛɛt hom bɛ̀ atsak awo. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Akak di se, fɛ́ a tsin cɛɛt naton hom, imi rēn fok kucɛɛt fɛ́ a cɛɛt naton hom, ku yet atsak.<verse eid="JHN 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />&lt;&lt;Iyin, mi tom yin banet sak narɔ aYohana, iwu mi ki tak yin atsak e. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Imi da in shashang kanu ifɛ̀ anet awo, in tsin fɛrɛng anɔng, gyan i di sɛ yin isheshek. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />AYohana kin yet agaramun, fɛ́ a ya kurong ne nesek mgbɛy, iyin kin shan yin mgbɛy wu ni iyɛ ikan nfi kizen hyiit.<verse eid="JHN 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />&lt;&lt;Imi bɛ̀ ifɛ̀ dɔng fi iwat idɔng, fɛ́ aYohana kin nɔk naton hom. Nek kutomong yɔng fɛ́ Ada di nɔk ira me, sak igang e, fi in se ni ra me, iko ko, ku tonoso fok Ada me wu fɛ́ a di tom. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Iwu Ada fɛ́ a di tom e, iwu mi nɔɔk kanu ifɛ̀ naton hom. Vit akak yin fɛ́ a ki mang fok kutɔ wu, kɛ fɛ́ a ki mang di nse wu ayi, <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />vit ifɛ̀ wu ayɛt ayɛ yin, nek iyin ra yin inɔɔk atsak ne ayɔng fi iwu tom e. <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Iyɔng i nye yin nyɛk ifá yin<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Nye yin nyɛk ifá yin </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ikyɛng ira.</char></note> Afumung Adakunom nek iyiring yin fok, i da sɛ yin kutset vit igang ayɛt na. Afumung Adakunom e yɔng cɛɛt naton hom, <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />ngma nɛ anɔng, ni ra yin dan bɛ́ yin ni mi nɔng da sɛ yin kutset.<verse eid="JHN 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />&lt;&lt;Da imi shashang itere fi ines nɛ banet awo, <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />nek imi ki rēn yin, imi rēn fok vit iyin ni ishim Adakunom ayɛt ayɛ yin. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Imi bɛ́ ni iyerek Ada min, iyin ra yin dan i di shan yin, wɛt kɛ akak bɛ́ ni iyerek wu, i da ku shan yin. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Na anɛ fi i da nɔɔk yin atsak ama fi i tsin tsɛsɛk yin itere na bafidang ɛ, da i ti daam yin ni i sɛ yin itere fi ines narɔ Adakunom aziwu awo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Afumung akak fɛ́ ba kin jɛk ni kubɔk na shon e bɛ̀ </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">&lt;&lt;atutup azining e.&gt;&gt;</char></note>?<verse eid="JHN 5:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />&lt;&lt;I bi di yin, ti imi wu in bi tse ni kukun yin, ashon Adakunom awo. Ayɔng fɛ́ a bi te kukun yin, yet aMusa, ayɔng fi i di te yin iyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Ki i kin fi nɔɔk yin atsak ne aMusa, ki i nɔɔk yin atsak ni mi, nek iwu kin jɛk naton in. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Ayet i rayin dan nɔɔk yin atsak ni ikyɛng fi iwu man jɛk, nɛ anɛ fi i da nɔɔk yin atsak ni ikyɛng fi in fɛ̀ yɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s">AYeso Ya ne banet agup atoon (5,000)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Ama kizen hyiit, aYeso tat sak ni nyi kuya kufi izek aGalili, fɛ́ ba yes iye aTibariyas, <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />kudyɛng banet kin ku kuus mo, nek ba kin di ntomong abes fɛ́ a nye, naton bafi nrɔk. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />AYeso ma ngarak ni ihwyanang, a tsɛ sonong azɔng gung nɛ bafi imɛɛs wu. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Ni izen amok aPasova baYahuda ngmash ni nye.<verse eid="JHN 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Ni izen fɛ́ aYeso ta ayisi a di kudyɛng banet fɛ́ ba se ni iku kuus mo, a tirik a rip aFilibus, &lt;&lt;AFilibus, akɛ fi nda tsin shan yit akpam, in di ya yit nɛ banet bang ɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />A fɛrɛng anɔng nek a di mara aFilibus, nek iwu rēn ikyɛng inye gyam.<verse eid="JHN 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />AFilibus fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Kɛ itsɔm itarang anet itomong nfi nfɛn nkara da kyem ba di shan akpam fɛ́ kaakyɛ anet fɛ́ a se azeng, di sɛ kicek e awo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Azining ayɛt bafi imɛɛs wu, fɛ́ ba ku yes Andarawus, arunyining aSiman Bitrus wat a fɛrɛng yɛ, <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />&lt;&lt;Kabacam kakak kang azeng fɛ́ ka bereng ágbang akpam atoon, ni ìzos ifaa akabɛs, awɛt idɔng da kyem akyɛ ni ngane ni kudyɛng banet tɛ ba bang ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;Fɛ̀ yin nɛ akaangan ne a sonong.&gt;&gt; Karɔ me kin bɛ̀ agam makiyi, batek fɛ́ ba kin se ni sosok, kin se agup atoon. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />AYeso ma sok akpam e, a ra awon natoon e, a kabasa banet fɛ́ ba se ni sosok e, a tɛ a ka ba kaba ìzos e anɔng ba, kaangan ya ma na ku kyem. <verse eid="JHN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Ama fɛ́ kaangan mi ya ba hwyas, aYeso ma fɛ̀ ne bafi imɛɛs wu, &lt;&lt;Tsi tusung yin ngma ikyɛng fi ikyɛk. Da i bi won yin ikikak bi beseng awo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Nek anɔng, ba tsɛ ba tusung ina, ba shining nakɔmɔng kusɔk abe afaa, ni icek akpam atoon afɛ́ alikama yɔng fɛ́ a tuk, ama fɛ́ banet yas ba hwyas.<verse eid="JHN 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Ama fɛ́ banet e di ntomong abes fɛ́ aYeso nye, ba kpa nye, &lt;&lt;Nɛ atsak e, Atan e yɔng, fɛ̀ ba kin fɛ̀, a bi bɛ́ azatse.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />AYeso mi tsang rēn fok ba shim ba di te nyeng ni wu ne a sot agwɔm ba, nek anɔng a ban ngarak yik-yik naton ihwyanang aziwu.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso tseng naton ashi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Fɛ́ kahwyɛ nye, bafi imɛɛs wu tseng sak ni izek e, <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />azɔng fɛ́ ba tsɛ ba nɔ ayɛt kukyɛ ashi, ba kpa wɔk sak ni nyi kuya sak ibɛ nɛ aKafarnahum. Ni izen yɔng, nɛ karɔ mi te hwyi, nɛ aYeso resek mo dan tse narɔ ba. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Nɛ ba resek mo naton itseet, awun agap kpa teng a fɛsɛm, ashi kpa ririm makiyi. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Ama fɛ́ ba mi tsɛ bakat amil ataat sak ataat ni ibit,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni ilem aGirik: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ba mi wɔk a stadiya nsɔk nfaa ke nsɔk ntaat ayi (bakat akilomita 5 sak 6).</char></note> ba fɛ̀ ba di aYeso na tsin tseng naton ashi, sak ibɛ narɔ kukyɛ ashi me, inyim ka ba yit makiyi. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Wɛt iwu fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;I bi fok yin nnyim awo, imi yɔng.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Nek anɔng wu, ba da ne ba shim ba ku nabak kubɔk, a sɛ a di nɔ ayɛt kukyɛ ashi me, ni izen izining, bafɛ́ ba di ba mi tse ba ta ni ice ibanang, sak narɔ fɛ́ ba tsin di tseng.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Akatson, kudyɛng banet fɛ́ ba se ni itot ni nyi kuya kufi izek e, bɛ́ ba nye kuyiring fok kukyɛ ashi kuzining ko ku kin di kyɛk azɔng, ba tɛ ba yiring fok da aYeso kin nɔ ni kukyɛ ashi me gung nɛ bafi imɛɛs wu awo, ba kin tseng aziba. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Akyɛ-ashi akak, fɛ́ a nes ne aTibariyas, a kin se ni nyeseng azɔng, bakat nɛ karɔ fɛ́ banet kin di ya akpam, ama fi aTisa mi di ra awon. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Ni izen fɛ́ kudyɛng banet e rēn fok vit aYeso nɛ bafi imɛɛs wu azɔng, ba nɔɔs ayɛt akyɛ-ashi me, ba tseng sak nɛ aKafarnahum ba tsɛ ba tsɛt aYeso.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Fɛ́ ba tsɛ ba ku sɛ, ni nyi kuya kufi izek e, ba ku rip yɛ, &lt;&lt;ARabay, nɛ a ki izen fi i mi bi i ta azeng ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Won in ki tak yin atsak, da iyin tsin di tsɛt yin nek kutomong abes fi i di yin awo, ayet nek akpam fi i ya yin, ihwyas yin wu. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />I bi sɔ yin mgbang kutomong nek nayak fɛ́ na beseng awo, tit nek nayak yɔng fɛ́ na sok izen ne na nesek kutset vit igang, fi Arim Anet da ki nɔɔk yin. Naton wu fɛ́ Ada Adakunom mi di te izizɔ acicɛ wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Banet e tɛ ba ku rip yɛ, &lt;&lt;Akyɛ fi nda nye yit, in di shining yit, ikyɛng fɛ́ Adakunom shim ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Ikyɛng de fɛ́ Adakunom shim ni nye yin: Nɔk yin atsak, na ayɔng fi iwu tom e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Ba tɛ ba ku rip, &lt;&lt;Akyɛ kutomong abes fi ngɔn da ki nye yit e, fi in da di yit, in di nɔɔk yit atsak ni ngɔn ɛ? Akyɛ fi i da ki nye yit e yɛ? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Badakop yit man ya amana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:31 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">amana</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Akpam yɔng fɛ́ a ne azanɛn.</char></note> ni izen fɛ́ ba kin se ni kutseet ayɛt ayit! Kpaf ti ifɛ̀ Adakunom di fɛ̀, &lt;AMusa kin ka ba nɔɔk akpam fɛ́ a ne azanɛn, yɔk nɛ ba ya.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;Won in ki tak yin atsak, da a kin yet aMusa wu fɛ́ a kin ki nɔɔk yin akpam fɛ́ a ne naton awo, Ada min wu fɛ́ a ki nesek yin atutup akpam fɛ́ a ne azanɛn. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Nek aKpam Adakunom yet ayɔng fɛ́ a nes azanɛn, fɛ́ a nesek banet azatse kutset.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Ba fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Akɔk-ashon, ki nesek yit kuri akpam e yɔng kaakyi izen.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />AYeso fɛrɛng, &lt;&lt;Imi wu in yet akpam e yɔng fɛ́ nesek kutset e. Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a bɛ́ ni mi, a bi tɛ fok nzong awo, ngma ayɔng fɛ́ nɔɔk atsak ni mi, a bi tɛ fok iyɛ ngash awo. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Tɛ fi in man ki tak yin, iyin nɔng i mi di yin akabɛs, i ni rayin dan nɔɔk yin atsak. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Ngma bayɔng fɛ́ Ada me di nesek, ba da bɛ́ ni mi, ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a bɛ́ ni mi, imi da ku ramin awo. <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />Nek imi ne azanɛn, da yɔk in bin ra kushim ice min awo, tit nek in ra kushim ayɔng fɛ́ a di tom. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Ikyɛng de fɛ́ ayɔng fɛ́ a di tom e shim, fok da ni in wey azining ayɛt bayɔng fi iwu di nɔɔk awo, tit ni in ka ba donong ni kutset atuk igang azatse. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Nek kushim Ada hom yet kaangan fɛ́ a di Ari wu, a di nɔɔk atsak ni wu, na a sɛ kutset vit igang, In bi ku donong ni kutset atuk igang azatse.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Nek anɔng, bakɔk-ashon baYahuda me kpa cɛɛt nɛ ba ceshek azobok, fok nek a fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Imi wu in yet akpam e yɔng fɛ́ a ne azanɛn.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Ba fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Anet yɔng yet aYeso arim aYusufu awɛ? Iyit rēn yit ada nɛ nggɔ wu awɛ? A da tsa anɛ a fɛ̀, &lt;Imi ne azanɛn sak ibɛ́ azeng ɛ?&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;I bi cɛɛt yin ni ceshek yin nanu awo. <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Vit anet fɛ́ a da kyem a bɛ́ ni mi, tit Ada fɛ́ a di tom, iwu fɛ́ a ku kɔrɔk, imi bi ku donong ni irɛk, atuk igang azatse. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />I se ni ijɛk nɛ afumung àware, &lt;Ngma ba, ba bi sɛ itees ni bɔk Adakunom.&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 54:13">AIshaya 54:13</ref></char>.</note> Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a fok itees Ada, a di te ni tomong, a bɛ́s ni mi. <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Vit akak fɛ́ ikuman di Ada me, tit ayɔng fɛ́ a ne narɔ Adakunom; iwu aziwu fɛ́ a ki mang di Ada me.<verse eid="JHN 6:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />&lt;&lt;Won in ki tak yin atsak, ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a nɔɔk atsak, a mi sɛ kutset vit igang gyam. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Imi wu in yet akpam fɛ́ a nesek kutset! <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Badakop yin kin ya amana ayɛt ayit, ngma nɛ anɔng ba kus. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Akpam e yɔng fɛ́ a ne azanɛn, fɛ́ ki anet ya, a da tɛ a ku awo. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Imi wu in yet akpam atset, fɛ́ a ne azanɛn. Kaangan fɛ́ a ya akpam e yong, a da sot ni kutset vit igang. Akpam e yong yet inam irɔm in, fi in da nɔɔk nek kazatse di ki sɛ kutset.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Wɛt baYahuda kpa nanan wɔɔn ba yɛ, &lt;&lt;Na anɛ, fɛ́ anet yong da ki nɔɔk yit inam irɔm wu ni in ya yit ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />AYeso ban fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;Won in ki tak yin atsak, ki da i ya yin inam irɔm Arim Anet, i ti i di sɔ yin nasok ka awo, vit iyin ni i sɛ kutset. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a ya inam irɔm in, a tɛ a sɔ nasok in, a bi kutset vit igang. Imi bi ku donong atuk igang azatse. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Nek inam irɔm in yet nayak natek, nɛ nasok yin yet ikyɛng isɔ itek. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a ya inam irɔm in, a tɛ, a sɔ nasok in, a di nak ni mi, imi ayɛt wu. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Kpaf kyɔn tɛ Ada fɛ́ a se ni kutset di tom, Imi se ni kutset nek Ada, nek anɔng ngma ayɔng fi Imi wu in yet kuyak wu, a da sɛ kutset nek Imi. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Akpam e yɔng fɛ́ a ne azanɛn. Badakop yin kin ya amana ba kus, wɛt ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a ya akpam ayong, a bi sot ayɛ vit igang.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />A kin nye kucɛɛt e kang nɛ tsin tees narɔ inyis ne aKafarnahum.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bafi ikuus dot te wangashing <optbreak /> ba won aYeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Fɛ́ ba fok anɔng, bafi ikuus wu dot fɛ̀ ye, &lt;&lt;Itees yeng sɛ gbang makiyi. Angan da kyem a shan iye ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />AYeso rēn fok bafi imɛɛs wu se ayɛt kudaam nek itees e, aYeso fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;Ikyɛng e ki daam yin ɛ? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Wat i bi nye yin anɛ, ni izen fi i bi di yin Arim Anet tsin ngarak sak narɔ fɛ́ ka di ne ɛ? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Kabik ka, ka nesek kutset; kurɔm bɛ̀ agap ikikak awo. Kucɛɛt fi in mi ki nye yin ne yet kabik<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:63 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Kabik.</char></note> ni Kutset. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Ngma na anɔng bakak yin raba dan nɔɔk atsak.&gt;&gt; Nek aYeso mi tsang rēn nkum itumung e, bayɔng fɛ́ ba raba dan nɔɔk atsak, nɛ ayɔng fɛ́ a bi ku rɛp. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />A ya kashon ni kucɛɛt yɛ, &lt;&lt;Ikyɛng de fi sak in kin di fɛ̀ ni yin, vit ayɔng fɛ́ a da bɛ́ ni mi tit Ada wu a nye anɔng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Nkum izen e yɔng bafi ikuus wu dot tɛ ba bun kama, da ba tɛ ba ku kuus mo awo. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Nek anɔng, aYeso tirik sak ni Kusɔk abe afaa me, a fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;Iyin da tseng in ba awɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />ASiman aBitrus fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Akɔk-ashon, in da tseng yit sak narɔ angan ɛ? Ngɔn wu fi i bɛ̀ ifɛ̀ fi inesek kutset vit igang. <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Iyit mi nɔɔk yit atsak, in mi rēn yit fok, ngɔn wu i yet aJɛrɛ me yɔng, fɛ́ a ne narɔ Adakunom.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 6:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />AYeso ma fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Imi wu, in ki kasa yin, Kusɔk abe afaa awɛ? Azining ayɛt yin yet aShetan.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />(Anet fɛ́ a se ni cɛɛt naton wu yet aJudas arim aSiman aIskariyoti, azining ayɛt Kusɔk abe afaa me akabɛs, fɛ́ a bi wey ni wu.)<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s">Baruneng aYeso raba dan nɔɔk atsak ni wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Ama anɔng, aYeso teng a kat nɛ aGalili, da a shim a tsɛ nɛ aJudiya awo, nek baYahuda se ni iku tsɛt, nɔng ba da ku fɛt. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Ni izen fɛ́ amok iyiring ni isosok na abut baYahuda bɛ́ bakat, <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />barunyining fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;I se gyat ni i won azeng, tsɛ na aJudiya, nɔng bafi ikuus ngɔn, da bin di, ntomong abes fi iras. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Vit anet fɛ́ a tsɛt a sot atsɔn, ras nkyɔrɔk ni nɛsɛk. Neme ngɔn ras ntomong nang, tonong kazatse ice ngɔn.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Nek ngma na barunyining, raba dan nɔɔk atsak ni wu ba.<verse eid="JHN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Nek anɔng, aYeso fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Izen hom resek dan nye, kaaki izen yet ifiin. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Kazatse da kyem ka ki ra yin, iyin awo, ka nyes icuna ni imi, nek imi ka ka taas, fok ikyɛng fɛ́ ka raas yet inɛn. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Iyin tseng yin sak narɔ amok e. Imi da kyem in tsɛ awo, nek izen yin resek dan nye.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Ama fɛ́ a fɛ̀ anɔng, a di wey na aGalili.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Ngma nɛ anɔng, ama fɛ́ barunyining mi tseng sak narɔ amok e, iwu ne tsɛ hwyɛɛ, ni nɛt, da na yisi banet awo. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Azɔng narɔ Amok e, bakɔk-ashon baYahuda di te ayisi gyang ba da ku di, ba teng ba risim, &lt;&lt;Anet e si kɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Banet fɛ́ ba se azɔng, teng ba cɛɛt naton wu. Bakak nye, &lt;&lt;A yet anet atek,&gt;&gt; nɛ bakak nye, &lt;&lt;Awɛy, a wɔrɔsɔ banet kyɛk.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Vit ayɔng fɛ́ a kyem a cɛɛt dɛdɛt naton wu, nek nnyim bakɔk-ashon baYahuda.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Ni izen fɛ́ Amok e ngmash kate, fɛ́ aYeso tsɛ narɔ iya Adakunom ntong, a kpa tees banet ifɛ̀ Adakunom. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Ikyɛng e te bakɔk-ashon baYahuda kpɔrɔk, ba kpa nye, &lt;&lt;Anet yong, tsɛ a se ice irēn deng akɛ? Iwu fɛ́ da a mang sɛ itees awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Ikyɛng fi in tees yet inaan awo, iyet ifɛ̀ ayɔng fɛ́ a di tom. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a shim a nye kushim Adakunom, a da rēn, fok ikyɛng fi in tees ne narɔ Adakunom, da iyet inaan awo. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Ayɔng fɛ́ a cɛɛt naton ice wu, a nye anɔng nek a di tsɛt ice wu iratek, wɛt ayɔng fɛ́ a tsin ra kutomong, nek iratek ayɔng fɛ́ a ku tom, ayɔng wu ayet anet atsak; da nbɔɔs se ayɛt ayɔng awo. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />AMusa wu a kin ki nɔɔk yin ntsi awɛ? Ngma ne nɔng vit akak yin fɛ́ a kyem a bereng ina. Ishim i di fɛt yin nek akyɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Banet e shim, ba fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn bi itseng ni rɔm ngɔn, angan wu fɛ́ a shim a da fɛt azeng ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;In ra kutomong abes kuzining kyɛk, ngma yin a ki te yin yɔɔt. <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Ngma nɛ nɔng nek aMusa kin fɛ̀ ni ras yin katse (atsak e yet fok da ba kin tumung katse me nɛ aMusa awo, i kun ne narɔ badakop wu), ngma nɛ anɔng iras yin nnon katse atuk aSabat. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Kɛ ba kyem, ba ra nggon katse atuk aSabat, dan ntsi aMusa ni ibeseng, awɛt akyɛ sak fɛ́ ayɛ yin beseng ni imi, fok nek in te anet burang kyang atuk aSabat ari? <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Won yin iras ishɔt ayisi, ras yin ishɔt atsak.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso yet Anet-Isheshek e yɛ?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Ni izen e yɔng, bakak ayɛt banet aRushelima kpa nye, &lt;&lt;Anet e yong fɛ́ ba shim ba fɛt iwu awɛ? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Ayong a tsin cɛɛt ni dɛt, vit akak ba fɛ̀ a kyem a fɛ̀ ni iwu ikikak. Kɛ bakɔk-ashon e mi nɔɔk atsak fok, yi iwu wu a yet aKristi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Anet-Isheshek</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Na abyat </char><char style="fv">27, 31, 41</char> nɛ <char style="fv">42</char>.</note> me yɛ? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Iyit rēn yit karɔ fɛ́ anet yong di ne; izen fɛ́ Anet-Isheshek e bi bɛ́, vit ayɔng fɛ́ a bi rēn karɔ fɛ́ a bi di ne.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Nɛ aYeso tsin irēn tees banet narɔ iya Adakunom ntong, a fɛrɛng nɛ agap, &lt;&lt;Ey, i di rēn yin, i rēn yin karɔ fi in di ne. Imi bɛ́ azeng ni ízɔk ice min awo, ayɔng fɛ́ a di tom yet atsak. Iyin da i ku rēn yin awo, <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />Imi ku rēn, nek imi ne narɔ wu, iwu fɛ́ a di tom.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Fɛ́ ba fok anɔng, ba tsɛt ba ku yit, wɛt vit akak ba fɛ̀ a nɛ a di sak kubɔk ni wu, nek izen wu resek dan nye. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Ngma nɛ anɔng, banet dot ayɛt bayɔng fɛ́ ba se azɔng, di te iyɛ ni wu. Ba fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Agyaa, izen fɛ́ Anet-Isheshek e yɔng bi bɛ́, a bi kyem a ra kutomong abes kukak fi ku wat ku fɛ́ anet yong ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />BaFarasi me fok ikyɛng fɛ́ banet se ni icɛɛt e kyukyuk naton wu. Agbat àware me nɛ BaFarasi me, tom bafi itosok Karɔ Iya Adakunom ntong nɛ ba tsɛ ba ku tekap.<verse eid="JHN 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;Imi yong mo azeng ni yin in fi kizen hyihyit, ama anɔng, in da bun sak narɔ ayɔng fɛ́ a di tom. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />I bi di tsɛt yin, vit i bi di sɛ yin awo; karɔ fi in bi di se, i bi kyem i tse yin awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />BaYahuda fɛ̀ nɛ bafidang, &lt;&lt;Akɛ fɛ́ anet e yong, shim a di tse, fi da iyit da kyem in ku sɛ yit mo awɛ? A shim a tsɛ sɛ banet yit fɛ́ ba mi kana ikaas nate BaGirik na tees BaGirik ɛ? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Akyɛ sak fɛ́ a di fɛ̀, &lt;I bi di tsɛt yin, vit i bi di sɛ yin awo yɛ,&gt; nɛ &lt;Karɔ fi in bi di sɛ, i bi kyem i tse yin awo,&gt; yɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso cɛɛt naton ashi fɛ́ a nesek kutset</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Atuk igang amok e, kunom e yɔng ko ku wat kuratek nɛ mok e, aYeso dorok tsik, a fɛrɛng nɛ agap yɛ, &lt;&lt;Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a foos iyɛ ingash, won na bɛ́ narɔ min a da sɔ. <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a nesek atsak ni mi, kpaf tɛ kufumung ajɛrɛ di fɛ̀, ákang ashi kutset da nes ayɛt wu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Ikyɛng fɛ́ aYeso se ni cɛɛt naton e yet Kabik, fɛ́ bayɔng fɛ́ ba nɔɔk atsak ni wu bi sɛ. Nek sak izen e yɔng, ba mi tsang tom nɛ Kabik aJɛrɛ awo, nek ba resek dan nɔɔk aYeso ízɔk.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Ni izen fɛ́ ba fok ifɛ̀ wu, bakak ayɛt banet e fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Atsak atsitsak, anet e yong yet àware me yɔng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Bakak ayɛt ba fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Iwu fɛ́ a yet Anet-Isheshek e.&gt;&gt; Bakak ayɛt ba nye, &lt;&lt;Na anɛ fɛ́ Anet-Isheshek e da ne nɛ aGalili yɛ? <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Afumung kin fɛ̀, yɛ Anet-Isheshek e bi ne ni izɔrɔk aDauda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni ilem aGirik </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ica.</char></note> nɛ aBatalami, ni wɔp fɛ́ ba di tes agwɔm aDauda awɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Nek anɔng, kuyiring banet kabasa naton aYeso. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Bakak shim ba ku tekap, wɛt vit ayɔng fɛ́ a di sak kubɔk naton wu.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Avit ishan atsak bakɔk-ashon baYahuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Ama anɔng, bafi itosok karɔ iya Adakunom ntong e, tɛ ba bun sak narɔ agbat àware nɛ BaFarasi me, fɛ́ ba kaba rip, &lt;&lt;Akyɛ sak fi da i bɛ́ yin ni wu awɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Bafi itosok karɔ iya ntong e fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Vit anet fɛ́ a ki mang cɛɛt tɛ anet e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />BaFarasi fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;Ye kyéé, iyɔng i fɛ̀ yin, a mi tsɛ a ki bɔrɔk yin bá yɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />&lt;&lt;Kɛ iyin mang fok yin akak ayɛt yit, bakɔk-ashon kɛ BaFarasi ayi, di nɔɔk atsak ni wu yɛ? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Awɛy! Tit áshɔp ánet yɔng fɛ́ da a rēn ikikak ayɛt ntsi awo, bayɔng fi kushi mi ka ba ya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />ANikodimos, iwu yɔng fɛ́ a kin tsɛ sɛ aYeso natuk, fɛ́ a yet azining ayɛt bà, rip yɛ, <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />&lt;&lt;Ntsi yit ki mang tsɛt anet ishɔt dan fok ifɛ́ wu ninyɛn nɔng ba bin rēn ikyɛng fɛ́ a nye yɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Ba fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn ne na aGalili bà yɛ? Tsi tsɛt ayɛt afumung da di, vit àware akak fɛ́ a ki mang ne na aGalili!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 7:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Afumung ilem aGirik afɛ́ ashon kin bɛ̀ abyat ye awo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JHN 7:53">AYohana 7:53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 8:11">8:11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Kaangan ba yit irèn ari wu.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s">Abining fɛ́ ba yit ni irɔs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Wɛt aYeso tsɛ ngarak ni Ihwyanang Ifat. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Nɛ bop adiding, a nɛ a bun sak narɔ iya Adakunom ntong, azɔng fɛ́ banet kusum tsɛ ba ku te nate, a sonong a kpa ka ba tees. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Bágwɔm ntsi nɛ BaFarasi, tsɛ ba ne, na abining akak, fɛ́ ba yit ni irɔs. Ba ku sak a nyeseng ashon banet, <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />ba ma rip aYeso, yɛ, &lt;&lt;Akɔk-ashon, ba yit abining yo, kpaf nɛ tsin ra irɔs. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Ntsi aMusa fɛ̀ ni yit fok nin bara yit kuri banyining e yɔng, nɛ ata. Akyɛ fi ngɔn fɛ̀ yɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Ba ku nye irip e yɔng, nɔng ba bin ku te mo agunung ba di te kukun wu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:6">Wɛt aYeso te nyɔk, a kpa jɛk aben ni itsambɔk. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Fi iba ya kashon ni i ku risim, a dorok tsik, a fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;Ayɔng fɛ́ a se vit inɛn ayɛt yin, na a tun worok kuta kufi imɛsɛng.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />A tɛ, a te nyɔk, a kpa ijɛk aben.<verse eid="JHN 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Fɛ́ ba fok anɔng, ba kpa nye myɛɛt bazizining, bashɔn tin tsees, bawosong di kuus, ba di won abining e aziwu ni nyeseng azɔng, nɛ aYeso. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />AYeso, tɛ a dorok tsik, a fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Ago, ba si kɛ? Vit akak ba fɛ̀ a da tsɛɛt ishɔt iku yɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Abining e fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Vit, akɔk-ashon.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:11">AYeso fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Imi ma in da tsɛɛt ishɔt iku awo. Tseng, i bi ti iras inɛn awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso yet mgbɛy azatse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Ni izen fɛ́ aYeso tɛ cɛɛt nɛ banet e, a fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;Imi yet mgbɛy azatse. Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a di kuus mo, a da tɛ tseng ayɛt nhwyi awo, a da sɛ mgbɛy iyɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />BaFarasi me, fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Di fi ngɔn nesek kanu icɛɛt naton ice ngɔn, kucɛɛt ngɔn yet atsak awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;Awɛt ki in fi in cɛɛt naton ice hom, kucɛɛt hom yet atsak, nek imi rēn karɔ fi in di ne, nɛ karɔ fi in tsin di tsɛ. Nek da iyin rēn yin karɔ fi in di ne, nɛ karɔ fi in tsin di tsɛ awo. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Iyin ras yin ishɔt kuri ifɛ́ banet; Imi tsɛk akak ishɔt awo. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Awɛt ki in fi ras ishɔt, ishɔt inaan yet ifɛ́ atsak, nek imi se azimin awo. In se gung nɛ Ada fɛ́ a di tom. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />I sɛ ni jɛk ni ntsi yin fok, kɛ banet bafaa mi nɔɔk kanu ifɛ̀, naton ikyɛng, isonong atsak. <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Imi yet azining ayɛt bafi icɛɛt naton ice hom, anet icɛɛt afɛ́ faa me, yet Ada, fɛ́ a di tom.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Ba ma ku rip, yɛ, &lt;&lt;Ada ngɔn e se akɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:19">AYeso fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Iyin da i di rēn yin awo, da i rēn yin Ada hom awo. Ki ifi i di rēn yin, ki i rēn yin Ada hom ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />AYeso kin nye kucɛɛt e kang, ni izen fɛ́ a kin se ni itees banet narɔ iya Adakunom ntong, bakat nɛ karɔ fɛ́ ba di nasap kunang. Ngma nɛ anɔng, vit ayɔng fɛ́ a di sak kubɔk naton wu, nek izen wu resek dan nye.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikɔrɔk kuto nek bafi iraba inɔɔk atsak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />AYeso tɛ a ban fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Imi yɔng in da tseng, i bi di tsɛt yin, i bi kus yin ayɛt anɛn yin. Karɔ fi in di ki tseng, i da kyem i tse yin awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Ikyɛng e, sak bakɔk-ashon baYahuda rip yɛ, &lt;&lt;Kɛ a da tse a fɛt ice wu yɛ? Kɛ nek anɔng wu fɛ́ a di fɛ̀, &lt;Karɔ fi in di ki tseng, i da kyem i tse yin awo,&gt; yɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />AYeso ya kashon ni kucɛɛt, &lt;&lt;Iyin yet yin bafɛ́ aben; Imi ne naton. Iyin yet yin bafɛ́ azatse kang; Imi yet afɛ́ azatse awo. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />In mi ki tak yin fok, i bi kus yin ayɛt anɛn in; ki da iyin nɔɔk yin atsak, fok imi wu in yet ayɔng fin fɛ̀ me awo, nɛ atsak e i da kus yin ayɛt anɛn yin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Ba ku rip fok, &lt;&lt;Ki tak yit, ngɔn yet angan ɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:25">AYeso fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Imi yet ayɔng, fi in mi sɔ ni in ki taas in e. <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Nkyɔrɔk di se dot, fi in da kyem in fɛ̀ naton yin, in ki ya yin mo ni ishɔt. Ngma nɛ anɔng, nkum ikyɛng fɛ́ ayɔng fɛ́ a di tom, fɛ̀ ni mi, ide de in taas kazatse, nek iwu yet atsak.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Iba kyem ba rēn fok a se ni icɛɛt naton Ada wu awo. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Nek anɔng, aYeso fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Ni izen fi i bi fi nabak in Arim Anet, ni izen e yɔng, fi i bi ni i rēn yin fok yi imi wu in yet ayɔng e, fi in fɛ̀ ni yin, fi da in ra ikikak awo, tit ikyɛng fɛ́ Ada fɛ̀ ni in nye. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Ayɔng fɛ́ a di tom, se gung ni mi; a tsin di won azimin awo, nek imi raas kushim iyɛ wu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Fɛ́ a se ni kucɛɛt, banet dot di nɔɔk atsak ni wu.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nnon na fi AIbrahim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />AYeso fɛ̀ nɛ baYahuda fɛ́ ba nɔɔk atsak ni wu, yɛ, &lt;&lt;Ki iya yin kashon ni inye in ikyɛng fi in ki tees yin, iyin ba iyet in batitup bafi ikuus hom. <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />Na anɔng wu fi i da rēn yin atsak, atsak e da ki bisik in.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Ba fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Iyit yet yit nnon aIbrahim, da iyit ki mang sot yit basam ni bɔk akak awo, ngɔn da tsa anɛ i fɛ̀ yɛ, ba da ki bisik yit ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Atsak fi in tsin ki tak in, ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a ras inɛn, a yet asam inɛn. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Fok in, asam bɛ atitup karɔ isot ari isam wu awo, tit nggon ari me ka, ka di wey azɔng ayɛ vit igang. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Nek anɔng, ki Nggon e ka, ka ki bisik in, i da se yin atitup ibisik. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Imi rēn, iyin yet yin nnon aIbrahim. Ngma nɛ anɔng, i shim i di fɛt yin, nek ibɛ yin kawat nek ifɛ́ hom awo. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />I mi ki taas yin, ikyɛng fi in di ashon Ada min, ni iyin, nyes yin ikyɛng fi i fok in na ada yin.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Narɔ. Nek anɔng, nye yin ikyɛng fi i ki mang fok in narɔ Ada me.</char></note>&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Ba fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Ada yit yet aIbrahim.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:39">AYeso tɛ fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;Ki i fi yet yin nnon aIbrahim, ki i nye yin ikyɛng fi iwu kin nye. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Ikyɛng fi i se aben yet, i mi sak in áyɛ yin fok ma i di fɛt in, anet fɛ́ a ki tak in atsak fi in fok nɛ Adakunom. AIbrahim kin ras nggɔn nɔng awo. <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Iyin tsin nye yin ikyɛng fɛ́ ada yin ras.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:41">Ba kpa ngɔɔt nanu yɛ, &lt;&lt;Da iyit yet yit, nnon irɔs awo! Ngak ada fi in bɛ́ yit yet Adakunom ice wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Kɛ Adakunom fɛ́ yet Ada yin, ki i di shim yin, nek imi ne narɔ wu, sak i bɛ́ azeng. Imi da in bɛ́ azeng nek ice min awo; Iwu fɛ́ a di tom. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Akyɛ sak ikyɛng fi in cɛɛt, ki se yin ni mgbang ɛ? I se anɔng, nek i rayin dan di te yin kuto ni ikyɛng fi in ki tees yin. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Iyin yet yin bafɛ́ ada yin aShetan, nek anɔng, i shim i nye yin ikyɛng fi i da ku terek iyɛ. Iwu yet anet ifɛs banet neme ni imɛsɛng e, vit ikyɛng fi i ku moon nɛ atsak, nek vit atsak ayɛt wu. Ngma izen fɛ́ a tsin karang abɔɔs, nggɔn wu yɔng, nek iwu yet anet nbɔs, adakop bafi nbɔs. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Ngma ne anɔng, nek imi ki tak yin atsak, i rayin dan di nɔɔk yin atsak! <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Kɛ akak ayɛt yin, bɛ̀ ikyɛng fi itonong inɛn fi imi ki mang ra yɛ? Kɛ atsak wu fi in taas, wat akyɛ de i ki ro yin ni inɔɔk atsak ɛ? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a yet a fɛ́ Adakunom, a foos ifɛ̀ Adakunom. Ikyɛng fi i ki ro yin, ni inɔɔk atsak yet, nek iyin yet yin bafɛ́ Adakunom awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikyɛng fɛ́ aYeso fɛ̀ naton ice wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />BaYahuda me fɛ̀ ni wu, yɛ, &lt;&lt;Nek anɔng, wu fi in di fɛ̀ yit, ngɔn yet anet aSamariya, itseng se ni rɔm ngɔn awɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Vit itseng fi i se ni rɔm hom, nek in nesek Ada min iratek wu, iyin ba ira yin dan di nesek yin iratek. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Da imi tsɛt iratek nek ice min awo, akak di se, fɛ́ a tsin di tsɛt e, iwu fɛ́ a yet anet ishɔt. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Won in ki tak in atsak, ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a foos ifɛ̀ min, a bi di iku awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Ni ifok anɔng, bakɔk-ashon baYahuda fɛrɛng, &lt;&lt;Yɔkɔnɔng fi in rēn yit, fok itseng se ni rɔm ngɔn! Kɛ banet tɛ aIbrahim kin kus, batan kin kus, ni ngɔn nye yɛ ayɔng fɛ́ a foos ifɛ̀ ngɔn, da a bi bamang iku awo. <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Ngɔn wat ada yit aIbrahim ɛ? Ngma nɛ anɔng a kin ku, kpaf anɔng fɛ́ batan kin di kus. Ngɔn di ti ngɔn yet angan ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Ki imi wu in tsin tsɛt ice min iratek kyɛk, iratek hom da sot ikikak awo. Ada hom, fi iyin nye yin, fok a yet Adakunom yin, iwu fɛ́ a di nesek iratek. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Iyin da i ku rēn yin awo, imi ku rēn. Ki imi fɛ̀ da in ku rēn awo, in da sot anet nbɔɔs ti iyin, imi ku rēn, in foos ifɛ̀ wu. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Adakop yin aIbrahim, kin nye iyɛ ikan, fɛ́ a kin nye kuyiring ni kubɛ́ hom; a kin di iko, a nye iyɛ ikan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />BaYahuda me fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn fi da i mi kyem ayɛ nsɔk ntoon awo, i man di aIbrahim a?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 8:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;Won in ki tak yin katsak, dan nɛ ba tes aIbrahim, imi di sɛ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Ni ifok anɔng, ba kok ata, nɔng ba da ku woro mo. Awɛt aYeso kana nɛnɛng a hwyet narɔ iya Adakunom ntong e.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s">AYeso te akpatɔn kyang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Izen fɛ́ aYeso se ni igot, a di akpatɔn fɛ́ ba ku tes anɔng. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Bafi imɛɛs wu ku rip yɛ, &lt;&lt;Anet Itees, angan wu a nye inɛn, anet yo kɛ batek fi i sak ba ku tes akpatɔn ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Ayet nek inɛn wu, kɛ i fɛ́ batek awo, i te anɔng mok ba di tonong kutomong Adakunom ni kutset wu. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Nɛ karɔ ren resek mo gbɛy, i se gbing-gbing ni in ra yit kutomong ayɔng fɛ́ a di tom. Katuk kang ka wuruk, fɛ́ vit anet fɛ́ a da kyem a ra kutomong. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Ni imi mo azeng azatse, Imi wu in yet mgbɛy azatse me.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Ama fɛ́ a fɛ̀ anɔng, a cik ncicɛ aben, a di gyɔrɔp irɔp, a di bas ide na ayisi anet e. <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />A da ma fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Tseng tsi so ni kudung aSilom.&gt;&gt; (ASilom yet Atom.) Nek anɔng, anet e tsɛ a so, a bun ari na yɛrɛ gyat.<verse eid="JHN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Bayɔng fɛ́ ba se bakat ni iwu, nɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba ku rēn tɛ anet awon, kpa cɛɛt wɔɔn ba, yɛ, &lt;&lt;Anet e yong fɛ́ a sosok nɛ ras awon awɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Bakak ba fɛ̀, iwu yɔng, nɛ bakak nye, &lt;&lt;Awɛy, ayong e tas ayɔng e.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">Wɛt nɛ anet e di fit inye, &lt;&lt;Ye imi yɔng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Nek anɔng ba ku rip, &lt;&lt;Wat na anɛ fɛ́ ayisi ngɔn di tarak ari?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />A fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Anet e yɔng, fɛ́ ba ku yes aYeso, wu fɛ́ a moon irɔp, a di bas e na ayisi, a ma fɛ̀ ni mi, &lt;Tseng sak ni dung aSilom, i da tsi so.&gt; Imi tsi in so, in wat in yɛrɛ gyat!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Ba fɛ̀ nɛ anet e, &lt;&lt;Anet e si kɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:12">A fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Imi rēn awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Nek anɔng, ba ku ta ashon sak narɔ BaFarasi. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Kunom e yɔng fɛ́ aYeso kin di gyɔrɔp irɔp e, a di te anet e kyang, kin yet aSabat. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Nek anɔng BaFarasi risim anet e ngma ikyɛng fi ite. Iwu, a ka ba tak yɛ, &lt;&lt;A bas irɔp e na ayisi hom, in tsin kanang, yɔkɔnɔng in yɛrɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Bakak ayɛt BaFarasi me fɛ̀ yɛ, &lt;&lt;Anet yong, nɛ narɔ Adakunom awo agyaa, di yin fɛ́ a rawu dan saas kunom aSabat.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:16">Bakak ayɛt ba fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Nɛ anɛ fɛ́ anet inɛn da kyem a raas ntomong ajingjing ti nnang ɛ?&gt;&gt; Nek anɔng, ikaba nɔ nate ba.<verse eid="JHN 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Ba ma tɛ ba tirik sak nɛ akpatɔn e, ba ku rip, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn fɛ̀, anet e da tarak ayisi, akyɛ fi ngɔn da fɛ̀ naton wu ɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:17">Anet e fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Iwu yet atan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Bakɔk-ashon baYahuda me raba dan nɔɔk atsak, fok a tsang yet akpatɔn, a nɛ sɛ ayisi. Nek anɔng ba tom ba kaba yes batek. <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />Ba kaba rip yɛ, &lt;&lt;Ari yin yong ɛ? Iwu me yɔng fi i ku tes yin akpatɔn ɛ? Wɛt akyɛ te, fɛ́ a yɛrɛ yɔkɔnɔng ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Batek e fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;Iyit rēn yit a yet ari yit, fi in ku tes yit vit ayisi akabes, <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />awɛt da iyit, ni in rēn yit, nɛ anɛ fɛ́ a di sɛ ayisi ke anet fɛ́ a ku tarak ina awo. A yong, ku rip yin, ayɛ wu mi kyem, fɛ́ a da fɛrɛng na kanu wu kɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Batek e cɛɛt anɔng nek ba foos nnyim bakɔk-ashon baYahuda me, nek bakɔk-ashon e mi nyeseng ifɛ̀, fok ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a fɛ̀, fok aYeso yet Anet-Isheshek e, ba da ku ro narɔ inyis. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Anɔng wu a sak batek e di fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Ayɛ wu mi kyem kɔ; Ku rip yin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Ba tɛ ba yes anet fɛ́ a tsang yet akpatɔn e iyes ifɛ́ faa, ba fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Nɔk Adakunom iratek. Nek iyit rēn yit aYeso yet anet inɛn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Anet e tɛ fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;Ke a yet anet inɛn a, kɛ awɛy ya, imi rēn idɔng awo. Ikyɛng izining fi imi rēn yet, imi tsang yet akpatɔn, in yɛrɛ yɔkɔnɔng!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Ba tɛ ba ku rip, yɛ, &lt;&lt;Akyɛ fɛ́ a da nye ne ɛ? Na anɛ fɛ́ a da tarak mo ayisi me ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Anet e fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;Imi mi ki tak in ayame, i tsin wes yin ato awɛ? Akyɛ sak fi i shim i ti fok yin ɛ? Kɛ iyin shim i sot yin bafi ikuus wu bá yɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Ba kpa ku korok itok yɛ, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn wu i yet afi ikuus anet yong! Iyit yet yit bafi ikuus aMusa. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Iyit rēn yit fok Adakunom kin cɛɛt nɛ aMusa, anet yong, iyit rēn yit karɔ fɛ́ a di ne ngma awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Anet e fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;In mi di ikyɛng ayɔɔt atut! I fɛ̀ yin da i rēn yin karɔ fɛ́ a di ne awo, ngma nɛ anɔng, a mi di tarak ayisi. <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Iyit rēn yit fok Adakunom foos bafi inɛn awo. A foos anet fɛ́ a bi nnyim wu, fɛ́ a raas ishim wu. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Neeme ni itumung kazatse, vit akak fɛ́ a ki mang fok, yɛ ba tarak ayisi anet fɛ́ ba ku tes ni iton. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Kɛ anet yong, fɛ́ a ne narɔ Adakunom awo, kɛ a kyem a nye ikyɛng ti ideng awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Nek anɔng ba fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn fɛ́ ba da tes, i rasak ayɛt anɛn; itsɛt, i da ki tees yit, iyit ɛ?&gt;&gt; Nek anɔng, ba ku ro Nitu Iya Adakunom Ntong.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikpatɔn Abik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />AYeso fok yɛ, ba mi ro anet e. Izen fɛ́ a ku sɛ, aYeso ku rip yɛ, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn nɔɔk atsak ni Arim Anet ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Anet e ku rip yɛ, &lt;&lt;Atekari, arim anet e yet angan ɛ? Di tak, akɔk-ashon, gyang in di nɔɔk atsak ni ka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn mi ku di yɔkɔnɔng, ayɛt atsak, iwu fɛ́ a tsin cɛɛt ni ngɔn kyɔrɔng!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Anet e fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Atekari, imi nɔɔk atsak!&gt;&gt; A kpa ku ya ntong.<verse eid="JHN 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />AYeso fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Imi bɛ́ azatse kang nek ira ishɔt, nɔng bakpatɔn da sɛ ayisi, nɔng bayɔng fɛ́ ba yɛrɛ da sot bakpatɔn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />BaFarasi fɛ́ ba se azɔng, fok ikyɛng fɛ́ a fɛ̀, ba ku nye irip, &lt;&lt;Akyɛ? Iyit yet yit bakpatɔn bá yɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Ki i fi yet in bakpatɔn, ki i bɛ̀ yin inɛn awo, awɛt yɔkɔnɔng fi i nye yin, fok iyɛrɛ yin, anɛn in resek gung ni iyin.<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s">Agup icɛɛt naton anek atek ni Ítsamang wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />&lt;&lt;Won in ki tak yin atsak, ngma ayɔng fɛ́ da a nɔ ni ikpara abak katisi me awo, ayet akpatang, nɛ afi itsang agap. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Ayɔng fɛ́ a nɔɔs abak katisi me, wu a yet anek ítsamang e. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Anet itosok katisi me, ku tarak e, ítsamang e, ku foos. A yes ítsamang wu, ni ayerek de, ni iku kuus mo sak amatse. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Ama fɛ́ a tun ide amatse, ni wu shan kashon de, ni ítsamang e ku kuus mo, nek ide rēn kutɔ wu. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Awɛt ide da kuus atsen awo, na tsak, i da teng i ku wosong nek ide rēn kutɔ atsen e awo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />AYeso ka ba nye igorok icɛɛt yeng, awɛt iba kyem ba rēn ikyɛng fɛ́ a se ni icɛɛt ni iba awo.<figure style="fig" alt="Shepherd and the sheepfold" file="lb00014c.tif" size="col" loc="JHN 10:6" copy="Louise Bass" ref="10:1-6">Anet itosok katisi ibón</figure><verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Nek anɔng, aYeso tɛ a fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Won in ki tak in atsak, Imi wu in yet katisi ikpara me. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Ngma bayɔng fɛ́ ba kin tin bɛ́ ashon hom, ba yet bakpatang, nɛ bafi itsang agap, ítsamang e ra de ifok ba. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Imi wu in yet katisi me, ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a nɔ abak hom, a da sɛ isheshek. A da nɔ nɛ wuruk nɛ sɛs nakpe. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Akpatang bɛ́s nek ikikak awo, tit nek itsang, ni ifɛt, ni ibeseng e; Imi bɛ́ nek ba bin sɛ kutset, na ba sɛ iko yɛt-yɛt.<verse eid="JHN 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />&lt;&lt;Imi yet anek atek e. Anek atek mees kutset wu nek ítsamang e. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Anek fɛ́ ba sok, da iwu fɛ́ a yet atek ítsamang e awo. Nek anɔng, kɛ a di agbayɔrɔ wuruk, nɛ won ítsamang e, nɛ teng akɔn wu. Nɛ agbayɔrɔ me bɛ́ ne kpa ítsamang e, nɛ tereng ide shangaring. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Anek e teng akɔn wu, nek a se ni kutomong itarang wu kyɛk, vit ikyɛng fi i kudaam ni ítsamang e.<verse eid="JHN 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />&lt;&lt;Imi wu in yet anek atek e; imi rēn ítsamang yin, ítsamang yin, di rēn, <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />kpaf te fɛ́ Ada di rēn, ni imi rēn Ada. In mees kutset in, nek ítsamang e. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />In bɛ̀ ítsamang ikak, fi da i se ni kukpara ku kang awo. I se gbing-gbing ni in bɛ́ ni ide. Ide da fok kutɔ min bà, nɔng kukpara me da sot kuzining nɛ anek azining. <verse eid="JHN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />Ikyɛng fi sak Ada min di shim, yet nek in mees kutset in, ni in ti in sok iko. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Vit anet isok kutset hom, imi wu in mees iko, ni in tin sok iko. In bi ice ni in mees, ni in tin sok iko. Ikyɛng fɛ́ Ada fɛ̀ ni in nye dɔng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Nek ifɛ̀ dɔng, nhwyɛ bakɔk-ashon baYahuda tin in kaba. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Bakak ayɛt ba fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Itseng se ni ngɔn, a mi kpa ririm. Akyɛ sak fi i ku foos yin ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Bakak ba fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Kucɛɛt yɔng da ku yet kufɛ́ anet fi itseng se ni wu awo. Itseng da kyem itarak ayisi akpatɔn ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">BaYahuda raba dan nɔɔk atsak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Izen amok Inabak Kutu Iya Mben nɛ aRushelima bi inye. Kpaf ni izen iwun, <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />aYeso kin se ni igorok narɔ iya adakunom ntong e abak karɔ fɛ́ ba yes ika Agubuk aSolomon. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Bakɔk-ashon baYahuda tsɛ ba ku te nate, nɛ ba ku risim yɛ, &lt;&lt;Sak akyɛ kuri izen fi ngɔn shim i ki won yit yuu yɛ? Ki ngɔn wu iyet Anet-Isheshek e, ni i ki tak yit wɛshɛk.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;In man ki tak yin, ira yin dan nɔɔk yin atsak. Kutomong abes fi in raas ni iyerek Ada min, iko kucɛɛt naton hom, <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />ngma nɛ anɔng, ni rayin dan nɔɔk yin atsak nek iyin yet yin ítsamang hom awo. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Ítsamang inaan foos kutɔ hom; Imi rēn ide, ide di kuus mo. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />Imi ka ba nesek kutset vit igang, ide bi wey awo; Vit ayɔng fɛ́ a da kyem na foshok ide ni bɔk hom. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Ada min fɛ́ a di nɔɔk ide, iwu wat kaangan nɛ agap; vit ayɔng fɛ́ a kyem na foshok ide ni bɔk Ada hom. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Imi nɛ Ada min, in yet yit bazining.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Bakɔk-ashon baYahuda tɛ ba kok ata, ba da ku bara mo. <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Wɛt aYeso fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Imi mi ki raas yin agbat ntomong abes dot, fi in nes narɔ Ada, kungan kang ko fi i shim i di bara yin mo nɛ ata naton ko yɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Bakɔk-ashon baYahuda me fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Nda ka bara yit nɛ ata naton ntomong abes fi i raas awo, ayet nek kucɛɛt ibyɛs Adakunom fi ines ni ngɔn, nek ngɔn anet awe, ni nye fok ngɔn yet Adakunom.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;I se ni ijɛk na afumung ntsi yin awɛ, fɛ́ Adakunom fɛ̀, &lt;Imi fɛ̀, iyin yet yin naban-adakunom.&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 82:6">Abom 82:6</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Iyit rēn yit fok ifɛ̀ Adakunom yet atsak, ki iwu kin yes bayɔng fɛ́ ba ku foos &lt;naban-adakunom&gt;, <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />wat akyɛ fɛ́ ba da yes azizɛɛt e yɔng fɛ́ Ada me mi myak, fɛ́ a tom e sak azatse ɛ? Akyɛ sak fi i di tsɛt in ni inɛn ibeseng iyerek Adakunom nek in fɛ̀ &lt;Imi yet Arim Adakunom&gt; ɛ? <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />I bi nɔɔk in atsak ni Imi awo, tit ma in se ni ira ikyɛng fɛ́ Ada min raas. <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />Ki Imi tsin nye ikyɛng fɛ́ Ada fɛ̀ ni in nye, ki da ishim i nɔɔk yin atsak ni imi awo, nɔɔk yin atsak nek ntomong abes fi iyɛrɛ yin, nɔng i da rēn yin, fok Ada me se ayɛt hom, imi se ayɛt Ada me.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Ba tɛ ba shim ba ku tekap, wɛt a sɛ kawat, a di got.<verse eid="JHN 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Ama anɔng, aYeso tɛ bun ni nyi kukyɛk aJodan nɛ narɔ fɛ́ aYohana kin di raas abatisma ni itumung e. A tsɛ sot azɔng, <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />banet dot tsees narɔ wu. Ba nye, &lt;&lt;Da aYohana kin ra kutomong abes awo, ngma nɛ anɔng, ngma kucɛɛt fɛ́ a kin ki nye yit e naton anet yong yet atsak.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Banet dot di nɔɔk atsak ne aYeso.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s">Iku aLazarus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Anet akak fɛ́ ba ku yes aLazarus kin se ni irɔk. Ayɛt aBetani, kaban wɔp fɛ́ aMarya nɛ anganyining aMata di se. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />AMarya me wu fɛ́ arunyining wu aLazarus kin ku rɔ, iwu me wu fɛ́ a kin korok aYeso name nkɔn ntek nɛ atak, a kin ku yɛs atak e nɛ akwoy ice wu. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Nek anɔng, banganyining te itom sak narɔ aYeso, &lt;&lt;ATisa, icɛk iyɛ ngɔn se ni irɔk.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Ni izen fɛ́ aYeso fok anɔng, a fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Kurɔk e kang yet kufi iku awo. Awɛy, ku yet kuyɔng fɛ́ Adakunom di ki sɛ iratek, nɔng Arim Adakunom di ki sɛ iratek ayɛt e.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />AYeso shim aMata nɛ anganyining nɛ aLazarus. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Ngma nɛ anɔng, izen fɛ́ a fok, yɛ aLazarus ku rɔ, a ban nye nkɔs nfaa azɔng narɔ fɛ́ a di se.<verse eid="JHN 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Ama anɔng, a nɛ a fɛ̀ nɛ bafi mɛɛs wu, &lt;&lt;Won in bun yit sak na aJudiya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Wɛt bafi imɛɛs wu fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Ka! Anet Itees, ni nkɔs nang, fɛ́ bakɔk-ashon baYahuda tsɛt ba da bara nɛ ata, ngma nɛ anɔng i shim in bun yit azɔng ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;Kaakyɛ kunom bɛ́ mgbɛy nfɛ́ agyip kusɔk abe afaa awɛ? Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a tsees ni mgbɛy, a turuk kutak awo, nek a yɛrɛ mgbɛy azatse nang. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a tsees ni irèn, vit mgbang nɛ a turuk kutak nek vit iwu ni mgbɛy.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Ama fɛ́ a mi gang ifɛ̀ me dɔng, a fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;Afidang yit aLazarus mi men nda; Imi shim in tsin ku shemeng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Bafi imɛɛs wu fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;ATisa, kɛ a se ni nda, a da te kyang kɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />AYeso se ni cɛɛt naton iku aLazarus, nɛ bafi mɛɛs wu sok fok a se ni nda.<verse eid="JHN 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Nek anɔng aYeso kaba tak wɛshɛk fok, &lt;&lt;aLazarus mi ku, <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />imi bi iyɛ ikan nek ikyɛng e te imi vit azɔng, nɔng i da nɔɔk yin atsak. Dorok yin in tseng yit narɔ wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />AToma, fɛ́ ba ku yes aDidimus<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">aDidimus</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Ni ilem aGirik yet kafɛrɛs.</char></note>, fɛ̀ ni ishɛrɛp bafi kuus e, &lt;&lt;Dorok yin, in tseng yit, in da tsin kus yit gung ni iwu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso yet idoro bafaben sak kutset</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Izen fɛ́ a tsɛ ta azɔng, aYeso tsɛ sɛ aLazarus mi nye nkɔs nnaas ni rɛk. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />ABetani se bakat amɛl afaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Bakat akilo ataat.</char></note> sak nɛ aRushelima, <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />nek anɔng, baYahuda dot tse akɔk ba aMata nɛ aMarya nek iku arunyining bá. <verse eid="JHN 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Nizen fɛ́ aMata fok fok aYeso wuruk, a dorok a tsɛ a ku shan ni irèn. AMarya di wey ari. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />AMata fɛ̀ nɛ aYeso, &lt;&lt;ATisa, ngɔn fi i se azeng, kɛ arunyining yit ku awo. <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Awɛt in rēn yɔkɔnɔng ana, Adakunom da ka nɔɔk ngma ikyɛng fi i rip.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Arunyining da tɛ dorok.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />AMata fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Imi rēn fok a bi tɛ dorok ni izen idoro bafaben atuk igang azatse.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Imi wu in yet idoro bafaben, imi wu in yet kutset. Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a nɔɔk atsak ni mi, kɛ a ku a bi sɛ kutset; <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a se ni kutset, fɛ́ a nɔɔk atsak ni mi, a bi ku awo. Ngɔn nɔɔk atsak nɛ anɔng ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />AMata fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Ey, aTisa, imi nɔɔk atsak fok ngɔn wu i yet Anet-Isheshek, Arim Adakunom e, yɔng fɛ́ ba fɛ̀ a bi bɛ́ na azatse.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Ama fɛ́ a fɛ̀ anɔng, a bun a yes anganyining aMarya ni fam, a ku tak fok, &lt;&lt;Anet Itees e mi bɛ́, a tsin da risim.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Izen fɛ́ aMarya fok anɔng, a wat a dorok ziri sak narɔ wu. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Na aYeso resek mo dan nɔ ayɛt kaban wɔp e, ni wu resek narɔ fɛ́ aMata di nyim ni wu. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Nizen fɛ́ baYahuda fɛ́ ba se gung nɛ aMarya nek akɔk, di fɛ́ a wuruk amatse ziri, ba ku kuus mo, ba yes fok nyan, a tse tos ni irɛk e.<verse eid="JHN 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Ni izen fɛ́ aMarya tsɛ ta narɔ fɛ́ aYeso di se, fɛ́ a ku di, a kpa natak wu, a fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;ATisa, ki ngɔn fi i se azeng, kɛ arunyining hom ku awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Nizen fɛ́ aYeso ku di a tsin tos, gung nɛ baYahuda fɛ́ ba tse gung ni wu, ikyɛng e ku ra iyɛ makiyi. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />A ka ba rip, &lt;&lt;I ku nɛt in akɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:34">Ba fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;ATisa, bɛ́ i da tsi di.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />AYeso tos.<verse eid="JHN 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />BaYahuda fɛ́ ba se azɔng fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Di yin fɛ́ a kushim!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Wɛt bakak ayɛt ba fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Iwu fɛ́ a kin tarak ayisi akpatɔn yame, akyɛ ku rone, inye ikyɛng fi i da rone iku anet yɔng ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso donong aLazarus ni irɛk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Ikyɛng e ban ra aYeso iyɛ, a serek bakat ni kurɛk e. Kurɛk e kin yet kusɔs fɛ́ ba fam kanu me ni kuta. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;Bingiring in kuta me sak ni fam.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:39">AMata, anganyining akaku me, fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Ka, aTisa! Yɔkɔnɔng a mi te nkɔn, nek a mi nye nkɔs nnaas atut.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />AYeso tɛ fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Imi mi fɛ̀ ni ngɔn, ki i nɔɔk atsak, i da di ízɔk Adakunom awɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Nek anɔng, ba bingiring kuta me. AYeso ma yɛrɛk sak naton, a fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Ada, imi da tere fi i mi di fok. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Imi rēn fok ngɔn di foos kaaki izen, wɛt in tsin fɛrɛng anɔng mok banet bang fɛ́ ba se ni nyeseng azeng, da nɔɔk atsak fok ngɔn wu i di tom.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Ama fɛ́ a mi fɛrɛng anɔng, aYeso yes ni kutɔ kuratek, &lt;&lt;aLazarus, wuruk amatse!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Akaku me wuruk amatse, ni mbɔk nɛ atak ni karam nɛ alinɛn, nɛ ayisi ni karam ni kudun ikpin.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:44">AYeso fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;Ku bisik in ares irɛk e, nɔng a da tseng!&gt;&gt; <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus raises Lazarus from the dead" file="DN00459b.tif" size="col" loc="JHN 11:44" copy="Dunham Images" ref="11:43-44">AYeso donong aLazarus ni irɛk</figure><verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ba tsɛt irén ifɛt aYeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Nek anɔng, baYahuda hwyɛt fɛ́ ba tse ite ashow aMarya, fɛ́ ba di ikyɛng fɛ́ aYeso nye, ba di nɔɔk atsak ni wu. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Awɛt bakak ayɛt ba, tsɛ ba tak BaFarasi ikyɛng fɛ́ aYeso ra. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Nek anɔng, agbat àware, nɛ BaFarasi, yes inyim kazumung karatek.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:47">Ba kpa tɔ wɔɔn ba yɛ, &lt;&lt;Akyɛ fi in se yit ayɛt e yɛ? Di yin fɛ́ anet yɔng tsin raas ntomong ajingjing. <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Ki in ku won yit na a ya kashon anɔng, banet kusum da nɔɔk atsak ni wu, nɛ banet aRoma bɛ́ ba shan mben yit nɛ Karɔ Iya Adakunom Ntong yit.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Wɛt azining ayɛt ba, fɛ́ ba ku yes aKayafas, fi iwu wu ayɛt agbat àware afi iyɛ me dɔng, fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;Vit ikyɛng fi iyin rēn yin! <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Iyin rēn yin fok I wat fɛ́ anet azining da ku nek banet, aza fi mben ngma da wey awɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 11:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Kucɛɛt kang fɛ́ aKayafas fɛrɛng da ayet kuyiring ice wu awo, tit tɛ agbat àware afi iyɛ me dɔng, a se ni taas ibes fok aYeso da ku nek mben baYahuda kusum, <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />iku wu yet nek mben baYahuda kyɛk awo, iyet ifi nnon Adakunom fɛ́ na se kaakɛ, bin di sot bazining. <verse eid="JHN 11:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Nkum atuk e yɔng, ba kpa tsɛt irèn isok kutset aYeso.<verse eid="JHN 11:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Nek anɔng, aYeso da a tɛ tsees ni dɛt ayɛt baYahuda awo. Nek anɔng, a tsɛ te myak ice wu nɛ kaban wɔp fɛ́ ba yes ika yɛ aIfrayim karɔ me yet katse, a tsɛ a sonong azɔng nɛ bafi imɛɛs wu.<verse eid="JHN 11:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Fi izen amok baYahuda fɛ́ ba yes aPasova bɛ́ bakat, banet dot wosong nɛ ban wɔp bá, sak nɛ aRushelima ba tsɛ ba kana kusu gyam nek amok aPasova me. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Ba woso itsɛt aYeso, fɛ́ ba nyeseng narɔ iya Adakunom ntong, ba woso risim banet, &lt;&lt;Iyin di yin tɛ a da bɛ́ amok e nang ɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Wɛt agbat àware nɛ BaFarasi, mi tsang tak banet fok ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a di karɔ fɛ́ aYeso di se, na tsɛ tak ziri, nɔng ba da tsɛ ba ku tekap.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s">Ba korok aYeso name ne aBetani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Nɛ amok aPasova resek mo ni nkɔs karataat, aYeso tsɛ a ta nɛ aBetani, ni wɔp fɛ́ aLazarus di sɛ, ayɔng fɛ́ aYeso kin kudorok ni irɛk. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Azɔng fɛ́ ba kin nye aYeso nayak ikɔs, ba ku nɔk mo iratek. AMata wu a kin yet afi ikaba me, aLazarus kin yet azining ayɛt bayɔng fɛ́ ba kin sonong narɔ iyak gung ni wu. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Wɛt aMarya tsɛ a nɛ, nɛ kaban tsung name nkɔn ntek, name me yet na fi itsɔm makiyi, ba kin nye ina nɛ anardis atek, a di korok ina na atak aYeso, na yɛs atak e nɛ akwoy ice wu. Kari me wat ka shan nkɔn ntek e.<verse eid="JHN 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Wɛt aJudas aIskariyoti, azining ayɛt bafi mɛɛs wu, iwu fɛ́ da nɛ a ku rɛp, a rawu ikyɛng fi ite, a fɛ̀, <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />&lt;&lt;Akyɛ rone dan nɛ ba rɛp name nang, fi itsɔm na tsaa itarang anet itomong nfi iyɛ burang, ba di gbinding bakan ni itsɔm e yɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Da iwu cɛɛt anɔng nek ishim ikak fi iwu bɛ̀ sak nɛ bakan e awo, tit nek a yet akpatang; iwu fɛ́ a berese amala itsɔm bá, a mi di mɛɛ nɛ yising ayit ikyɛng fɛ́ ba sas na di ses ice wu.<verse eid="JHN 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Nek anɔng aYeso fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Ku won in, imi sak iyɛ itusung name nang nek kunom inɛt hom. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Iyin resek yin gung nɛ bakan kaaki izen azeng, da iyin di ki sɛs yin azeng kaaki izen awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Nizen e yɔng baYahuda dot mi fok, yɛ, aYeso mi tse azɔng, banet e tse azɔng e nek aYeso kyɛk awo, nɔng ba bin di di aLazarus, ayɔng fi iwu kin ku donong ni irɛk. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Nek anɔng, agbat àware me, se ni itsɛt irèn fɛ́ ba di ki fɛt aLazarus bà, <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />fok nek ikyɛng fi ite ni iwu, i sak baYahuda dot di tsees narɔ aYeso nɛ ba nesek atsak ni wu.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso nɔ na aRushelima <optbreak /> tɛ atsɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Akatson, banet dot fɛ́ ba tse nek amok e, ba fok fok aYeso yɔng a wuruk sak inɔ nɛ aRushelima. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Nek anɔng, ba tsɛ ba bɔs atop izizerek ba berese ni mbɔk, ba tsɛ ba ku shan na abom, na ba nye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">&lt;&lt;AHosana!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">&lt;&lt;Awɛng se gung nɛ ayɔng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:13">fɛ́ a bɛ́s ni iyerek aTisa!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">&lt;&lt;Awɛng se gung</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:13">nɛ agwɔm aIsrela!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />AYeso sɛ ka tarakey, a di ngarak naton e, kpaf tɛ ba kin di jɛk,<verse eid="JHN 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />&lt;&lt;Da i bi fok yin nnyim awo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:15">icɛk iyɛ hom aSihiyona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:15">Di yin agwɔm yin wuruk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:15">ni sonong naton ka tarakey.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Nizen e yɔng, da bafi mɛɛs wu kyem ba rēn ikyɛng e dɔng nizen e yɔng awo. Tit ama fɛ́ ba mi nɔk aYeso ízɔk, fɛ́ ba ne ba yiring fok ba kin jɛk nkyɔrɔk e naton wu, fok ba nye nkyɔrɔk e yɔng naton wu.<verse eid="JHN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Banet yɔng fɛ́ ba kin se azɔng, nizen fɛ́ aYeso kin yes aLazarus ni irɛk, a ku donong ni kutset, teng ba shara ifɛ̀ me. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Banet dot tse ishan wu nek ikyɛng ajingjing fɛ́ ba fok fok fɛ́ a ra. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Nek anɔng, BaFarasi kpa tɔ wɔɔn ba yɛ, &lt;&lt;I di yin ayɛ! Vit iyit ni ikyɛng inye kong. Di yin fɛ́ kazatse ngma kusum mi run kama wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso tak ibes iku wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Bafɛ́ aGirik bakak se ayɛt bayɔng fɛ́ ba tse ni aRushelima nek iya Adakunom ntong nizen amok. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Ba tse narɔ aFilibus, fɛ́ ayet anet aBatseyida afi mben aGalili, ba ra awon ni wu yɛ, &lt;&lt;Akɔk-ashon, in shim in di yit aYeso.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />AFilibus tsɛ, a tak Andarawus itom e, ngma bá, ba tsɛ ba rip aYeso.<verse eid="JHN 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Izen mi nye fɛ́ ba da nɔɔk Arim Anet iratek. <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Won in ki tak yin atsak, kɛ da ba tup ica alikama aben, ma i ku ninyɛn awo, i di ki wey aziye. Ki i ku, i da tu tang, i da tes ica dot. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Anet fɛ́ a shim kutset wu, a da bit iko, wɛt ayɔng fɛ́ a nɔɔk nwa kutset wu azeng azatse kang, a se ni sak iko sak ayɛ vit igang. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Kaakɛ anet fɛ́ a shim a di ra kutomong, i se gbing-gbing nɛ a di kuus mo, karɔ fi imi di se, asam in da se azɔng ba. Ada min da te zɔk ngma bayɔng fɛ́ ba tsin di ra isam.<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />&lt;&lt;Yɔkɔnɔng nasok di kpas ni iyɛ, akyɛ fi in da fɛ̀ yɛ? Kɛ ni in fɛ̀, &lt;Ada, di tun ayɛt izen iyɔm deng ɛ&gt;? Awɛy, a yet nek mgbang e nang wu fi in bɛ́. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Ada, sak iyerek ngɔn ni i sɛ iratek.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:28">Kutɔ ma ne naton aza, yɛ, &lt;&lt;Imi man nye anɔng, in da tin ban nye ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Kudyɛng banet fɛ́ ba se azɔng, fok kutɔ me, Bakak ayɛt ba fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Izá dɔng i rumung dɔng.&gt;&gt; Nɛ bakak nye, &lt;&lt;Atomaza yɔng a fɛrɛng ni wu yɔng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Kutɔ kang, bɛ́ nek iyin wu, da nek Imi awo. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Izen e yeng fɛ́ ba da ra kazatse kang ishɔt; yɔkɔnɔng fɛ́ ba da ro agwɔm kazatse kang. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Awɛt nizen ba bi di sok azatse, in bi kɔrɔk banet kusum sak narɔ hom.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />A fɛrɛng anɔng, nek a di tonong kuri iku fɛ́ a bi ku.<verse eid="JHN 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Kudyɛng banet e fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Iyit mi fa yit, ayɛt kufumung ntsi yit fok, Anet-Isheshek bi di nak ayɛ nɛ ayɛ, wat akyɛ sak fi ngɔn fɛ̀, &lt;I se gbing-gbing ma ba nabak Arim Anet ɛ?&gt; Angan wu a yet Arim Anet e yɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />AYeso ma fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Mgbey e da se ni yin in fi kizen hyihyit. Nye yin kutseet ni mgbey irēn resek mo, dan ahwyi bi bɛ́ a ki shuu yin. Anet fɛ́ a tsees ne ahwyi rēn karɔ fɛ́ a di tseng awo. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Di te yin iyɛ ni mgbɛy ni in ren resek, nɔng i da bin sot in nnon mgbɛy.&gt;&gt; Ama fɛ́ a mi gang kucɛɛt e, aYeso tsɛ nɛt ice wu ni ba.<verse eid="JHN 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Banet raba inɔɔk atsak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Ngma ni ntomong abes fɛ́ aYeso raas nɛ yisi bá, ngma nɛ nɔng ba raba dan nɔɔk atsak ni wu. <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />Anɔng e te nɔng ba bin di shining ifɛ̀ fɛ́ atan aIshaya kin fɛ̀,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">&lt;&lt;ATisa, angan mi nɔɔk atsak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:38">ni ifɛ̀ yit ɛ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">Sak na angan Adakunom da tonong</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:38">kukyem wu ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Nek anɔng, ba raba dan nɔɔk atsak, nek ti aIshaya di jɛk narɔ kakak:<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />&lt;&lt;A mi ka ba te ikpatɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">a mi fɛɛs ayɛ bá,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">nek anɔng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">ba da kyem ba di yɛrɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">nɛ ayisi ba awo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">kɛ nɛ ba rēn ikyɛng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">nɛ ayɛ ba awo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">kɛ nɛ ba tirik sak ni mi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">nɔng in ka ba te kyang awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />AIshaya kin tsin cɛɛt naton aYeso, nek a kin di ízɔk wu, a cɛɛt naton wu. <verse eid="JHN 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Ngma nɛ anɔng, banet dot, nɛ bashɔn ba di nɔɔk atsak ni wu. Wɛt ba da nɛ ba kyem ba tonong atsak ba wɛshɛk awo, nek ba foos inyim BaFarasi da ka ba ro narɔ inyis; <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />Nek iba wat ishim banet ka ba tere aza Adakunom.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />AYeso ma fɛrɛng ne agap, &lt;&lt;Kɛ anet nɔɔk atsak ni mi, inɔɔk atsak wu, se ni mi kyɛk awo, i se sak ne ayɔng fɛ́ a di tom. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Kɛ a tsin di yɛrɛ, a tsin yɛrɛ ayɔng fɛ́ a di tom yɔng. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Imi bɛ́ azatse ti mgbɛy, nɔng vit ayɔng fɛ́ a di nɔɔk atsak ni mi, fɛ́ a di ki wey nɛ nhwyi.<verse eid="JHN 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />&lt;&lt;Sak nɛ ayɔng fɛ́ a foos ifɛ̀ min, nɛ rawu dan nye ide, imi da ku ra ishɔt awo. Nek da imi bɛ́ azatse nek ira ishɔt awo, tit nek in sheshek e. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Anet fɛ́ a di rawu, fɛ́ a rawu dan shan ifɛ̀ min, anet ishɔt wu di se, ifɛ̀ me dɔng fi in cɛɛt, ide de i bi ku ya ni ishɔt atuk igang azatse. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Nek itees fi in raas, da ines narɔ min awo, Ada min fɛ́ a di tom, iwu fɛ́ a di taas ikyɛng fi nda fɛ̀, ni ikyɛng fi nda nye. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Imi rēn fok itabak wu, yɛ fi i nesek kutset vit igang. Nek anɔng ngma ikyɛng fi in cɛɛt, yet ikyɛng fɛ́ Ada di tak.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s">AYeso kusu atak bafi imɛɛs wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Nɛ ngmash nɛ ba ra amok aPasova, aYeso mi rēn gyam fok izen mi nye, fɛ́ a da won kazatse kang, sak ibun narɔ Ada wu. Nek aYeso mi tonong ishim, sak nɛ bafuu fɛ́ ba se azatse kang, a ka ba tonong ishim wu sak ni igang e.<verse eid="JHN 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Nawuwuri, aYeso nɛ bafi mɛɛs wu se ni iya nayak atuk, nɛ aShetan mi tsang te ni iyɛ aJudas aIskariyoti arim aSiman, fok na wey na aYeso. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />AYeso rēn gyam fok Ada wu, mi nɔɔk kaaki ikyɛng ni bɔk wu, a tɛ rēn fok iwu ne narɔ Adakunom, a bi tɛ bun sak narɔ wu; <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />Nɛ ba tsin ren yas, aYeso dorok tsik, a tun kunyin kpin wu, a sok icɛk ikpin, a rosom nɛ awit wu. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Ama anɔng, a korok ashi ni itsɛn iratek, a kpa di kusu atak bafi imɛɛs wu, nɛ di kuus iyɛs e, ni icɛk ikpin e yɔng fɛ́ a rosom nɛ awit wu.<figure style="fig" alt="Jesus washing his disciples feet" file="WA03912b.tif" size="col" loc="JHN 13:5" copy="Wade Images" ref="13:2-5">AYeso kusu atak bafi imɛɛs wu</figure><verse eid="JHN 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Fɛ́ a ta narɔ aSiman Bitrus, a fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;ATisa min, ngɔn shim i di kusu imi atak ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn da kyem i rēn ikyɛng fi in se nɛ yɔkɔnɔng awo; azeng sak ashon, i bi ni i rēn gyat.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />ABitrus fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Ka awɛy! Ngɔn di ki kusu imi atak awo.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:8">AYeso tɛ fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Kɛ da in da kusu atak awo, ikikak di moon ni ngɔn awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />ASiman aBitrus fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Nkum atak kyɛk awo, di kusu mbɔk ni ice ngma kusum!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Anet fɛ́ a mi so, tsɛt ikusu atak kyɛk, kurɔm wu se cɛl. Iyin se yin cɛl da ngma yin awo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Nek iwu rēn anet fɛ́ a da wey ni wu, nek anɔng wu fɛ́ a di fɛ̀, da ngma yin fi i se yin cɛl awo.<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Ama fɛ́ a mi gang i ka ba ikusu atak, a sok anyin kpin wu a te, a da tɛ bun narɔ isonong wu. A ma ka ba nye irip, &lt;&lt;Iyin rēn in ikyɛng fi i sak, in ki nye yin anɔng ɛ?<verse eid="JHN 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />&lt;&lt;Iyin di yɛs yin, &lt;Anet Itees&gt; nɛ &lt;ATisa&gt; ifɛ̀ yin yet atsak, ikyɛng fi imi yet yɔng. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Ki imi fi in yet aTisa yin nɛ Anet Itees yin, in ki kusu yin atak, i se kpaf, ni kusu yin bafidang e bà <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Imi mi ki tonong yin ikyɛng ira, nɔng iyin da ra yin bafidang e bà, kpaf ti fi imi ki ra yin e. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Won in ki tak yin atsak, vit asam fɛ́ a wat atekari wu ni iratek, vit atom fɛ́ a wat anet fɛ́ a ku tom. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Yɔkɔnɔng fi i mi rēn yin nkyɔrɔk nang, i da sɛ yin iyɛ ikan ki i nye yin ina.<verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso tak ibes anet fɛ́ a da wey ni wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />&lt;&lt;Da in tsin cɛɛt kucɛɛt kang naton yin ngma awo; Imi rēn kuri banet fin kasa. Wɛt nek ikyɛng fɛ́ ba man jɛk ni fumung ajɛrɛ di shining: &lt;Ayɔng fɛ́ a tsin yas ni itsɛn izining ni imi, a mi sot anet ifà ni mi.&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />&lt;&lt;In tsin ki tak yin gyam dan ni ite, nɔng ni izen fi i bi te, i bi nɔɔk yin atsak fok imi wu in yet Ayɔng e mɛɛ. <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Won in ki tak yin atsak, kaakyɛ anet fɛ́ a shan anet fi in ku tom, Imi wu fɛ́ anet e di shan; kaakyɛ anet fɛ́ a di shan imi, a shan Ada hom fɛ́ a di tom.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Ama fɛ́ aYeso mi gang kucɛɛt e yɔng, iyɛ wu beseng makiyi, a wat a tarak ifɛ̀ me wɛshɛk, yɛ, &lt;&lt;Won in ki tak yin atsak, azining ayɛt yin, da tsɛ a di rɛp.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Bafi imɛɛs wu kpa kana yɛrɛ, vit dan rēn anet fɛ́ a di cɛɛt naton e. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Azining ayɛt ba, fɛ́ aYeso dung di te iyɛ ni wu, a se ni sonong, a mi te yɛndɛng ni kufam wu. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />ASiman aBitrus ku te kyɛbɛt, a fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Ku rip angan wu fɛ́ a di cɛɛt e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Nek anɔng, anet e ban te yɛndɛng ni fam aYeso, a ku rip yɛ, &lt;&lt;ATisa, angan wu ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />AYeso tɛ fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Ayet ayɔng fi in da ku nɔɔk icɛk akpam, ama fi in sok iye ayɛt itsɛn.&gt;&gt; Yɔng a sok icɛk akpam, a sok a nɔɔk aJudas aIskariyoti arim aSiman. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Nizen fɛ́ aYahuda shan icɛk akpam e, aShetan wat a ku nɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:27">AYeso fɛ̀ nɛ aYahuda me, &lt;&lt;Ikyɛng fi i shim i nye, tsi nye ide ziri ziri!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Ayɛt bayɔng fɛ́ ba se narɔ iyak e, vit akak ba fɛ̀ a kyem a rēn ikyɛng fi i sak aYeso di fɛ̀ ni wu anɔng. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Nek aJudas wu fɛ́ a yet anet iberese amala itsɔm bá, bakak ba yes gyang, aYeso tsin ku taas fok, na a tsɛ na shan ikyɛng fɛ́ ba da ya amok e, kɛ na a tsɛ nɔɔk bakan iyin ikyɛng ayi. <verse eid="JHN 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Ama fɛ́ aYahuda shan icɛk akpam e, a wuruk amatse. Izen e yɔng, kin se natuk.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso tak ibes nanan fɛ́ aBitrus da nye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Ama fɛ́ aYahuda mi tseng, aYeso fɛ̀ ni ba, Yɔkɔnɔng wu fɛ́ Arim Anet mi sɛ iratek, Adakunom mi sɛ iratek nek iwu. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />Kɛ Adakunom sɛ iratek nek iwu, Adakunom da tonong Ari me iratek ice wu, a da ku nɔɔk izɔk izen izining.<verse eid="JHN 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />Nnon yin, in da sot ni iyin nfi kizen hyiit. I di ki tsɛt yin, kyɔn ti in kin di tak bakɔk-ashon baYahuda, nek anɔng in tsin ki tak yin yɔkɔnɔng: &lt;&lt;Karɔ fi in di ki tseng, iyin da kyem i tse yin awo.<verse eid="JHN 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />&lt;&lt;In tsin ki nɔɔk yin agbat ifɛ̀ ifas: Shim yin bafidiin. Kyɔn ti imi ki shim yin, anɔng wu i da shim yin bafidiin bá. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Nɛ anɔng wu ngma banet da rēn, fok iyin yet yin bafi ikuus hom, ki i shim yin bafidiin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />ASiman aBitrus ku rip yɛ, &lt;&lt;ATisa, ngɔn da tseng sak akɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:36">AYeso fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Karɔ fi in tsin di tseng, ngɔn da kyem i di kuus mo yɔkɔnɔng awo, i bi ni i di kuus mo azeng sak ashon.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />ABitrus fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;ATisa, akyɛ da rone, in da kuus mo yɔkɔnɔng ɛ? In da mees kutset yin nek ngɔn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn da kyem i mees, kutset ngɔn nek imi yɛ? Won in da tak atsak, dan atsanyon nɛ a tɛp, ngɔn da nye nanan in, kataat!<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s">AYeso yet irèn sak narɔ Ada me</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />&lt;&lt;Da iyɛ yin bi beseng awo. Nɔk yin atsak nɛ Adakunom, ni nɔk yin atsak ni mi bà. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Ari Ada min, narɔ isosok di se dot; ki da anɔng awo, ki in man ki tak yin. Imi yɔng, in tsin nye karɔ azɔng nek iyin. <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Ama fi in tsin nye karɔ nek iyin, in bi tun bun, in ki sok yin nɔng i da sonong yin ni mi, nɔng iyin da se yin gung ni mi bà. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Iyin rēn yin irèn sak karɔ fi in tsin di tseng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />AToma fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;ATisa, iyit da in rēn yit karɔ fi ngɔn shim i di tse awo, nɛ anɛ fi in da rēn yit irèn e yɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;Imi yet irèn, atsak, ni kutset. Vit anet fɛ́ a tse narɔ Ada, ma a got ni mi. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Ki i fi di rēn yin, ki i rēn yin Ada hom bá. Nkum atut, iyin mi ku rēn yin, i mi ku di yin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />AFilibus fɛ̀ yɛ, &lt;&lt;ATisa, ki tonong yit Ada me nɔng kudaam yit da gang.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />AYeso fɛ̀ yɛ, &lt;&lt;AFilibus, ngma nizen fi in mi nye ni yin, ngɔn di rēn awɛ? Ngma anet fɛ́ a mi di di, a mi di Ada hom yɔng. Akyɛ sak fi ngɔn da fɛ̀, &lt;Ki tonong yit Ada me yɛ&gt;? <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Ngɔn nɔɔk atsak fok imi se ayɛt Ada me, nɛ Ada me se ayɛt hom awɛ? Kucɛɛt fi in ki nyes yin e, da in cɛɛt iko nɛ agap ice min awo, ayet Ada fɛ́ a se ayɛt hom, fɛ́ a se ni kutomong wu. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Nɔk yin atsak kin fɛ̀, imi se ayɛt Ada, nɛ Ada se ayɛt hom; Kɛ ni nɔɔk yin atsak nek ntomong abes fi iyere yin ayi.<verse eid="JHN 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />&lt;&lt;Won in ki tak yin atsak, ngma anet fɛ́ a nɔɔk atsak ni imi, a da ra kuri ntomong fi in raas. A da raas ntomong fi in wat in nang, nek imi yɔng in bun sak narɔ Ada hom. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Kaakyi ikyɛng fi i rip yin ni iyerek hom, in da ki nye yin e, na anɔng fɛ́ banet da ki di iratek Ada hom. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Kaakyi ikyɛng fi i rip yin ayɛt iyerek hom, in da nye ide.<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso fɛ̀ a da tom na Kabik aJɛrɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />&lt;&lt;Ki i di shim yin, i da nye yin ifɛ̀ hom. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />Imi da ra awon sak na Ada hom, a da ki tom yin nɛ Afi itabak, fɛ́ a bi sot gung ni yin, ayɛ nɛ ayɛ. <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />Afi itabak e, yet Kabik fɛ́ ka tees banet atsak. Banet azatse da kyem ba ku shan na ayɛ ba awo, nek iba ki mang ku di awo, ba ku rēn awo. Iyin ku rēn yin, nek a se gung ni yin, a da ya kashon ni isot ayɛt yin. <verse eid="JHN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />Imi da ki won yin tɛ nakpin awo; in bi ti in bɛ́, in ki se yin. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Izen kyɛk hyiit, kazatse da tɛ ka di di awo, iyin bi ti i di di yin. Imi yet atset, nek anɔng, iyin bi sɛ yin kutset bà. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Atuk e yɔng, i bi rēn yin, fok Imi se ayɛt Ada min, iyin se yin ayɛt in, ni imi ayɛt yin. <verse eid="JHN 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />Kaakyɛ anet fɛ́ a rēn ntsi hom, na nyes ina, ayɔng wu fɛ́ a foos ifɛ̀ hom. Ayɔng fɛ́ a foos ifɛ̀ hom, Ada, da ku tonong ishim, imi di ki te iyɛ ni wu, in da ku tonong ice min wɛshɛk.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />AJudas (Ayong yet aYahuda aIskariyoti awo) a fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;ATisa, akyɛ sak fi ngɔn shim i ki tonong ice ngɔn aziyit kyɛk, da nɛ bafɛ́ azatse awɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a di shim, a da fok ifɛ̀ hom. Ada min da kushim, in da sonong yit gung ni wu. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a rawu dang di shim, da fok itees in awo. Kucɛɛt kang fi i tsin foos yin, yet kunaan awo; ku yet kufɛ́ Ada fɛ́ a di tom. <verse eid="JHN 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />In ki tak yin kucɛɛt kang, ni imi ren resek ni iyin. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Awɛt kɛ Afidang Itseet e, Kabik aJɛrɛ me, ayɔng fɛ́ Ada bi ki tom yin e, ni iyerek hom, iwu bi ki tees yin kaakyɛ, na ki yiring yin ngma ikyɛng fi in ki mang ki tak yin. <verse eid="JHN 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />Kukyang fi in tsin ki won yin e, kukyang kunaan fi ki nɔɔk yin. Da in ki nɔɔk in kuyɔng fɛ́ kazatse nesek awo. I bi won yin iyɛ yin ni kudaam awo, i bi fok yin nnyim awo.<verse eid="JHN 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />&lt;&lt;I mi fok yin, fi in fɛ̀ ni yin, &lt;Imi yɔng in tseng, in bi tin bi in ki se yin.&gt; Ki ifi i di shim yin, ki i bɛ̀ yin iyɛ ikan, fi in shim in bun narɔ Ada hom, nek Ada di wat ni iratek. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />In ki tak yin gyam dan ni ite, nɔng ki i bi ite, i bi nɔɔk yin atsak. <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />In da ti in bang cɛɛt dot awo; nek igwɔm azatse kang yɔ́ng a wuruk. Da iwu bɛ̀ agap naton hom awo, <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />Awɛt kazatse da rēn fok imi shim Ada, fok imi nyes kpaf ikyɛng fɛ́ Ada fɛ́ ni mi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 14:31">&lt;&lt;Dorok yin; in won yit azeng.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s">Kakon nɛ Ahwyang e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />AYeso fɛ̀ yɛ, &lt;&lt;Imi yet kakon anap kafe atsak e, Ada hom yet anet ikap ikɔ me. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Iwu tɛm kaakyi ihwyang ni imi fi i iraye dang tes, na nye kaakyi ihwyang fi ites ica, nɔng i da ban korok kutes. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Iyin se yin cɛ́l nek ifɛ̀ fi in mi ki tak yin. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Di nak yin ni mi, imi di ki nak ni yin. Vit ihwyang fi i da tes ica aziye, tit i di nak nɛ itin akon e. Nɛ anɔng, iyin da tes yin ice awo, ma i di nak yin ni mi.<verse eid="JHN 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />&lt;&lt;Imi yet kakon anap e; iyin yet yin ahwyang e. Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a di nak ni mi, imi di ki nak ni wu, a da korok kutes makiyi. Kɛ da ni mi awo, vit ikyɛng fi i da kyem i nye yin. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Ngma anet fɛ́ a rawu dan di nak ni mi, a se kpaf ti ihwyang fɛ́ ba barak iye, i koot; ihwyang ti idɔng, ba kok ide nɛ ba bara ni árong, ni kurong ya. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Ki i di nak yin ni mi, ifɛ̀ hom di nak ni yin, rip yin ngma ikyɛng fi i shim yin, ba da ki nɔɔk yin. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Ane nesek Ada iratek, fok ni tes yin ica dot, ni tonoso iyin yet yin bafi ikuus hom.<verse eid="JHN 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />&lt;&lt;Kpaf tɛ fɛ́ Ada hom di tonong ishim, anɔng fi Imi ki shemeng ba. Di nak yin ni ishim hom. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Ki ifoos yin ifɛ́ hom, i di ki nak yin ayɛt ishim hom, kyɔn ti imi di foos ifɛ́ Ada hom, ni in di nak ni ishim wu. <verse eid="JHN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />In tsin ki tak yin anɔng, nɔng iyɛ ikan hom, da se ayɛt in, nɔng iyɛ ikan yin bin shining. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />Agbat ifɛ̀ hom yo: Shim yin bafidiin, kyɔn ti imi kin ki shim yin. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Vit anet fɛ́ a bɛ̀ ishim fi iwat iyeng: anet na mees kutset wu nek bafidang wu. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Iyin yet yin bafidang hom, ki i nye yin ikyɛng fi in fɛ̀ ni yin. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Imi ti in ki yes yin basam awo, nek asam kyem a rēn ikyɛng fɛ́ atekari wu se ne awo. Tit Imi ki yes yin bafidang hom, nek kaakyɛ fi in mɛɛs na Ada hom, in mi ki tonoso yin. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Da iyin ba i di kasa yin awo, tit Imi wu in ki kasa yin, in ki te yin, ni ites yin ica-ica fi ita ice. Na Ada ki nɔɔk yin ngma ikyɛng fi i ku rip yin ni iyerek hom. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Agbat ifɛ̀ min yo: Shim yin bafidiin.<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kazatse raka Bafi Ikuus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />&lt;&lt;Kɛ kazatse ki rayin, ni yiring yin, ka kin tun di ramin imi. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Ki i fi iyet yin bafɛ́ azatse, kɛ kazatse me ki shim yin tɛ bafuu. Kusɛ yɔkɔnɔng, iyin yet yin bafɛ́ azatse awo, nek imi man ki kasa yin ayɛt banet azatse; nek anɔng fɛ́ kazatse me ki rayin mo. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Yiring yin ni kucɛɛt fi in man ki tak yin: &lt;Vit asam fɛ́ a wat atekari wu ni iratek.&gt; Kɛ ba kin di nesek izot, kpaf anɔng fɛ́ ba da ki nesek yin izot ba. Kɛ ba kin fɛ́ ba di fok imi, ke ba ki fok yin bà. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Ba da ki nesek yin iyɔm anɔng, nek iyerek hom, nek da ba rēn ayɔng fɛ́ a di tom awo.<verse eid="JHN 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />&lt;&lt;Kɛ da in kin fi in bɛ́, in bin in cɛɛt ni ba awo, kɛ vit iba ni inɛn. Yɔkɔnɔng, vit iba ni irèn ihwyet nek anɛn bà. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a di ramin, a rawu Ada min bà. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Ki in kin fi ra ntomong abes nate ba, fɛ́ vit akak fɛ́ a kyem a ra awo, kɛ vit iba ni inɛn. Wɛt yɔkɔnɔng fɛ́ ba mi di ikyɛng fi in mi nye, ngma nɛ anɔng, ba di raba, ngma nɛ Ada min. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Awɛt ite anɔng, nek ba di shining ikyɛng fɛ́ ba kin jɛk ni ntsi ba yɛ, &lt;Ba di ramin zɔng anɔng kyɛk.&gt;<verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />&lt;&lt;Ni izen fɛ́ Afidang Itseet e bi bɛ́, ayɔn fi in bi ki tom yin ne fɛ́ a ne narɔ Ada, Kabik atsak fɛ́ a bi ne narɔ Ada, a bi cɛɛt akuce hom. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Iyin bi ishara yin bà, nek iyin kin se yin gung ni mi, neeme ni meseng e.<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />&lt;&lt;In kin ki tak yin nkyɔrɔk nang ngma, kɔng i bi bun yin kama ayɛt inɔɔk atsak yin. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Ba bi ki ro yin ne narɔ inyis. Atsak e yet fok izen bi nye fɛ́ ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a ki fɛt yin, bi di tɛ a tsin di sɛ Adakunom kutomong. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Ba bi ki nye yin anɔng, nek da ba rēn Ada min, ni imi awo. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />In kin ki tak yin nkyɔrɔk nang, nɔng izen e bi fi nye, i bi yiring yin fok, in man ki tak yin. In kin ki tak yin nkyɔrɔk nang ni imɛsɛng e awo, nek imi irēn resek ni yin.<verse eid="JHN 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutomong Kabik aJɛrɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />&lt;&lt;Yɔkɔnɔng fi in mi bɛ́ bakat ibun sak ne ayɔng fɛ́ a di tom. Ngma nɛ anɔng, vit akak ayɛt yin fɛ́ a mi di rip yɛ, &lt;Akɛ fi i shim i di tse yɛ?&gt; <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Iyɛ yin beseng, nek in ki tak yin kucɛɛt kang. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Imi tsin ki tak yin atsak: I da mak ki se yin gyat imi ni tseng. Nek kɛ da imi tseng awo, Afidang Itseet e da bɛ́ ni yin awo; Ki imi tseng, in bi ki tom yin ni wu. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Izen fɛ́ Afidang Itseet e bi bɛ́, a bi tonong banet azatse wɛshɛk fok, kuyiring bà yet kumaan e naton nggɔn anɛn, nɛ naton kusonong ajɛrɛ, ni ishɔt: <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />Kuyiring bà naton anɛn se kpaf awo, nek ba raba dang di te agap ni ikuus in; <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />Kuyiring bà yet kumaan e naton nggɔn ntek, nek imi yɔng in tin bun sak narɔ Ada hom, iyin bi ti i di di yin awo. <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />Kuyiring bà yet kumaan e naton ishɔt, nek ba mi ya agwɔm azatse kang ni ishɔt.<verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />&lt;&lt;Imi bɛ̀ ishɛrɛp nkyɔrɔk dot fi in da bang ki tak yin, nek in da ki nanang yin yɔkɔnɔng. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Ni izen fɛ́ Kabik fɛ́ ka tees atsak e bi bɛ́, a bi ki tonoso yin narɔk atsak e ngma. Da a bi cɛɛt kushim ice wu awo, tit ikyɛng fɛ́ ba ku tak, a bi ki taas yin nkyɔrɔk fi in bi te. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />A bi sak banet nɛ ba di iratek hom, nek a bi ra kutomong ni ikyɛng fɛ́ a fok ni mi, na di cɛɛt ni yin naton e. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Ngma ikyɛng fɛ́ Ada hom bɛ̀, yet inaan. Nek anɔng fi in di fɛ̀, Kabik e bi ra kutomong ni ikyɛng fi imi fɛ̀, na ki taas yin.<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibeseng iyɛ bi bun iyɛ ikan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />&lt;&lt;Ni kizen gyeet, i bi di di yin vit, ama kizen gyeet, i bi ti i di di yin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Bakak ayɛt bafi imɛɛs wu me kpa risim bafidang, &lt;&lt;Akyɛ de fɛ́ a cɛɛt naton e, fɛ́ a fɛ̀, &lt;Ni kizen gyeet, i bi di di yin vit, ama kizen gyeet, i bi ti i di di yin ɛ?&gt; Akyɛ de fi iyet kuyiring wu fi sak a di fɛ̀, Nek Imi yɔng in tin bun sak narɔ Ada hom ɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Ba ya kashon ni i nye, &lt;&lt;Akyɛ yet, &lt;Kizen gyeet e yɔng ɛ&gt;? Iyit kyem in rēn yit ikyɛng fɛ́ a di cɛɛt naton e awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />AYeso rēn fok ba shim ba ku rip naton e, nek anɔng, a fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;I tsin risim yin bafidang fok akyɛ fi in cɛɛt naton e, fi in di fɛ̀, &lt;Ni kizen gyeet, i bi di di yin vit, ama kizen gyeet, i bi ti i di di yin ɛ&gt;? <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Won in ki tak yin atsak, i bi tos yin, ni nye yin kafa kawe, ni izen e yɔng, banet azatse bi nye iyɛ ikan. I nye yin kafa kawe, ngma nɛ anɔng, kafa kawe yin bi bun iyɛ ikan. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Di yin fɛ́ kɛ abining tsin nɔ wu, nɛ rus ni izen e yɔng, nek mgbang. Nkum fɛ́ a tes nggon wu, ni mgbang e te vit nek iyɛ ikan fok, ba mi sɛ atsen azatse.<verse eid="JHN 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />&lt;&lt;I se kpaf anɔng ni yin: Yɔkɔnɔng i se yin ne kafa kawe, in bi tin bi in ki sɛ yin, ni izen e yɔng, ayɛ yin bi tɛrɛk, vit anet fɛ́ a bi tɛ a ki kam yin ni iyɛ ikan yin. <verse eid="JHN 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />Atuk e yɔng, i bi ti i di rip yin ikikak awo. Won in ki tak yin atsak, Ada hom bi ki nɔɔk yin kaakyi ikyɛng fi i ku rip yin ni iyerek hom. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Sak atut, iyin da i mi rip yin ikikak ni iyerek hom awo. Rip yin, ba da ki nɔɔk yin, nɔng iyɛ ikan yin bin shining.<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />&lt;&lt;Sak atut, In rēn cɛɛt ni yin, ni igorok icɛɛt, izen bi nye fi da in bi ti in cɛɛt ni yin ni igorok icɛɛt awo. In bi cɛɛt ni yin wɛshɛk naton Ada hom. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Ni izen e yɔng, i bi raas yin awon ni iyerek hom. Da imi wu fi in bi ki raas yin awon e awo, iyin bi risim yin Ada ikyɛng yin, <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />nek Ada hom ice wu, ki shim yin, nek ishim fi iyin di tonong in, i nɔɔk yin atsak fok, Imi ne narɔ wu. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Imi ne narɔ Ada hom, sak ibɛ azatse kang; in mi yɔng ngmash ni in won kazatse kang, sak ibun narɔ Ada min.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Bafi imɛɛs wu fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Yɔkɔnɔng wu fi i tsin cɛɛt wɛshɛk, vit igorok icɛɛt. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Yɔkɔnɔng wu fi in rēn yit fok ngɔn rēn kaaki ikyɛng, da i se gbing-gbing fok ma akak da rip ninyɛn i da ni i ku tak kuyiring wu awo. Nek anɔng wu fi sak in di nɔɔk yit atsak fok, ngɔn ne narɔ Adakunom.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />AYeso ka ba nye irip ye, &lt;&lt;Iyin nɔɔk yin atsak yɔkɔnɔng ɛ?<verse eid="JHN 16:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />&lt;&lt;Izen bi bɛ́, iyeng i mi nye, fɛ́ ba bi ki kas yin. Kaangan ayɛt yin, bi yit irèn sak ari wu, i bi di won in azimin. Ngma ne anɔng, imi bi se azimin awo, nek Ada hom bi se gung ni mi.<verse eid="JHN 16:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />&lt;&lt;In tsin ki tak yin ikyɛng deng anɔng, nɔng i da bin sɛ yin kusonong kukyang ayɛt hom. Azatse kang, i da sɔ yin iyɔm. Nye gbinding yin! Nek Imi mi sɛ awɛng naton kazatse.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s">Awon fɛ́ aYeso ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Ama fɛ́ aYeso mi gang kucɛɛt e yɔng, a sok ayisi sak azanɛn, a ra awon ye, &lt;&lt;Ada, izen mi nye. Tonong banet azatse ízɔk Nggon ngɔn, nɔng Nggon ngɔn bin sak ne ba di ízɔk ngɔn. <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Nek ngɔn mi nɔɔk ari me ice naton banet ngma kusum, nɔng a da nesek kutset vit igang, sak ne bayɔng fi ngɔn mi ku nɔɔk. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Kutset vit igang e se ane: banet e bin da rēn mo, ngɔn azingɔn fi i yet Adakunom atsak, ne ba rēn aYeso Kristi, te ayɔng fi ngɔn tom e sak azatse. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />In mi tonong kazatse ízɔk ngɔn, nek in mi gang kutomong fi ngɔn di nɔɔk ira me. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Ada, yɔkɔnɔng di nɔɔk iratek hom dɔng fi in tsang bɛ́ ashon ngɔn neme dan ne ba nye kazatse.<verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />&lt;&lt;Imi ma da tonong weshek sak ne bayɔng fi ngɔn mi myak iba azeng azatse, i di nɔɔk iba. Ba yet bafɔɔn; ngɔn wu i di nɔɔk iba. Ba mi bereng ifɛ̀ ngɔn. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Yɔkɔnɔng ana, ba rēn ngma ikyɛng fi ngɔn di nɔɔk, i ne narɔ ngɔn. <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />Nek itom fi ngɔn di nɔɔk iye, imi mi ka ba nɔɔk, ba shan iye. Ba rēn fok ne tsak e, imi ne narɔ ngɔn, ba mi tɛ ba nɔɔk atsak fok ngɔn wu i di tom.<verse eid="JHN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />&lt;&lt;In tsin ka ba ra awon. Imi tsin ra kazatse awon awo, tit nek bayɔng fi ngɔn di nɔɔk iba, nek iba yet bafɔɔn. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Ngma ikyɛng fi imi bɛ̀, yet ifɔɔn, ngma ikyɛng fi ngɔn bɛ̀, yet inaan. Iratek mi di bɛ́ ni mi nek iba. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Imi ngmash ni bun sak narɔ ngɔn. In di ki wey azeng azatse awo. Iba irēn resek mo azeng azatse. Ada, ngɔn fi se jɛrɛ, ka ba bereng ayɛt agap iyerek ngɔn, iyerek dɔng fi ngɔn ki mang di nɔɔk neme, nɔng ba da bin sot bazining, ti iyit di se yit. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Izen fi imi se ni ba, in ka ba bereng ayɛt agap iyerek yɔng ngɔn kin di nɔɔk. Vit akak ayɛt ba fɛ̀ a mi wey, tit azining e yɔng, fi i se gbing-gbing ne a wey e, nɔng ikyɛng fɛ́ ba ki mang jɛk ne afumung ajɛrɛ di shining.<verse eid="JHN 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />&lt;&lt;Imi yɔng in bɛ́ bakat ibun sak narɔ ngɔn. In tsin cɛɛt kucɛɛt kang, ni mi irēn resek mo azeng azatse, nɔng iyɛ ikan hom, bin se ishining ayɛt ayɛ ba makiyi. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />In mi ka ba nɔɔk ifɛ̀ ngɔn, nek anɔng, banet azatse ka ba raba, nek da iba yet bafɛ́ azatse awo, kpaf ti fi imi yet afɛ́ azatse awo. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Da imi tsin ra awon fok, ni ka ba tun ayɛt azatse awo, in tsin ra awon fok, ni ka ba bereng, kɔng amaan e bi ka ba ra. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Da iba yet bafɛ́ azatse awo, kpaf ti fi imi da in yet afɛ́ azatse awo. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Ka ba te cɛ́l, nɔng ba bin sot bafɔɔn ne atsak e. Nek ifɛ̀ ngɔn de iyet atsak e. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Kpaf ti fi ngɔn di tom sak azatse, anɔng wu fi imi tsin ka ba tom sak azatse me ba. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Nek iba wu fi in di nabak ice hom cɛ́l, nɔng iba di sot cɛ́l ne tsak e ba.<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />&lt;&lt;Nek ba bang wu kyɛk, fi in tsin di ra awon awo, in tsin ra awon ngma naton bayɔng fɛ́ ba bi di nɔɔk atsak ni ifɛ̀ ba. <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />Nɔng ngma ba, ba bi sot bazining, kpaf ti fi imi se ayɛt ngɔn, ngɔn se ayɛt hom, in tsin ra awon, won iba ne ba sot ayɛt yit anɔng ba. Ne anɔng wu fɛ́ banet azatse di ki nɔɔk atsak, fok ngɔn wu fi i di tom. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />Iratek yɔng fi ngɔn ki mang di nɔɔk, imi mi ka ba nɔɔk ide ba, nɔng iba bin sot bazining, kpaf ti fi iyit di se yit. <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />Imi da sot ayɛt ba, ngɔn da sot ayɛt hom, nɔng ba bin sot bazining yɛɛt-yɛɛt, nɔng ba da rēn fok ngɔn ka ba shim, kpaf ti fi i di shim.<verse eid="JHN 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />&lt;&lt;Ada, imi shim ba bang fi ngɔn mi di nɔɔk, ne ba sot gung ni mi narɔ fi imi di se, nɔng ba da di kuratek ízɔk min, fi ngɔn man di nɔɔk neme dan ne ba nye kazatse, nek ishim fi ngɔn bɛ̀ ni mi.<verse eid="JHN 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />&lt;&lt;Ada, ngɔn fi iyet afɛ́ atsak, ngma ne anɔng, kazatse da rēn awo, imi da rēn, bafi ikuus hom bang, rēn fok ngɔn wu fi i di tom. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Imi mi ka ba tonong weshek anet fi ngɔn yet, in da ya kashon ni inye anɔng, nɔng iba bin se kuri ishim fi ngɔn di tonong, nɔng imi da sot ayɛt ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s">Ba Tekap aYeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Ama fɛ́ aYeso mi gang ira awon e, iwu nɛ bafi imɛɛs wu, ba tse ba tat kukyɛk aKidiron. Ni nyi kuyɔng e, igɔɔt ikak di se fɛ́ ba di tuus nakon ifat, aYeso tse azɔng nɛ bafi imɛɛs wu. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />AJudas yɔng fɛ́ a da rɛp aYeso, a tsang rēn karɔ me yɔng, nek aYeso mi di mɛɛ ne ba nyis azɔng nɛ bafi imɛɛs wu. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Nek anɔng, aJudas sok kudyɛng banet itsom, nɛ bafi itosok karɔ iya mben fɛ́ agbat àware, nɛ BaFarasi ka ba tom; Ngma ba, ba tse azɔng ni igɔɔt e, ba berese agaramun, nɛ ákon irong, nɛ ares itsom.<verse eid="JHN 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />AYeso mi tsang rēn ngma ikyɛng fi i da te ni wu, nek anɔng, a wuruk sak amatse, a ka ba rip, &lt;&lt;Angan wu fi itsɛt yin ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Ba fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;In tsɛt yit aYeso anet aNazaret.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">AYeso fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;Imi wu in yet iwu.&gt;&gt; (AJudas anet irɛp wu me se ni nyeseng azɔng gung ni iba.) <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Izen fɛ́ aYeso fɛ̀ ni iba ye, &lt;&lt;Imi wu in yet iwu,&gt;&gt; ba serek amirima, ba kpas aben.<verse eid="JHN 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />AYeso tɛ a ka ba rip ye, &lt;&lt;Angan wu fi iyin tsɛt yin ɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:7">Ba fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;AYeso anet aNazaret.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;In mi fɛ̀ ni yin, Imi wu anɛ, kɛ ayet Imi wu fi i tsin di tsɛt yin, ni won in banet ba ne ba tseng.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />A fɛrɛng anɔng, nɔng kucɛɛt fɛ́ a kin fɛ̀, di shining, &lt;&lt;Ada, ayɛt banet fi ngɔn mi di nɔɔk, vit azining fɛ́ a mi wey.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Awɛt aSiman Bitrus fɛ́ a se na awal, a kɔrɔk iwu, a di tɛmɛng asam agbat àware, a ku tun kuto ibɔk iyak. (Iyerek asam e yet aMalkus.)<verse eid="JHN 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />AYeso fɛ̀ ne aBitrus, &lt;&lt;Te sɔɔn awal ngɔn ni bas wu! Ngɔn di ti, in da sɔ ne aridɛ fɛ́ Ada di nɔɔk awɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ba tse ne aYeso ashon Anas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Agbat bafi itsom e, nɛ banet wu, ngma banet itosok karɔ iya Adakunom ntong baYahuda tekap aYeso, ba ku rosom. <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />Ba tin tse ni wu ashon Anas, iwu yet atek aKayafas. AKayafas wu fɛ́ a kin yet agbat àware afi iyɛ me dɔng. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Iwu aKayafas wu fɛ́ a kin nɔɔk bakɔk-ashon baYahuda itabak fok, i wat gyat anet azining ne a ku aza banet kusum.<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nanan fɛ́ aBitrus tin nye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />ASiman aBitrus, nɛ afi-imɛɛs wu akak, ba teng ba di kuus aYeso ama. Afi-imɛɛs e me yɔng, tsang rēn agbat àware me, nek anɔng wu fɛ́ ba ku won mo a di kuus aYeso sak atasa agbat àware me. <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />ABitrus di wey ni nyeseng amatse, ne tisi kasa me. Afi-imɛɛs e me yɔng, fɛ́ agbat àware ku rēn e, a tɛ bun, a tse a fɛrɛng ne kanamang fɛ́ ka yet kafi itosok katisi me, a da ne a di nɔ ne aBitrus.<verse eid="JHN 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Kanamang fɛ́ ka se ni itot katitu me, rip aBitrus ye, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn yet azining ayɛt bafi imɛɛs anet e yong awɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:17">ABitrus fɛ̀ ni ka, &lt;&lt;Awey yo! Imi di se awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Karɔ me kin se cere, nek anɔng, basam ari me, nɛ banet itosok karɔ iya mben, ba fɛp kurong, ba nyeseng azɔng, ba se ni ifos e. ABitrus tse nyeseng azɔng narɔ ifok kurong e ba.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Agbat-agbat àware <optbreak /> nyes aYeso nrisim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Agbat àware me, nyes aYeso irisim naton bafi ikuus wu, ni kuri itees fɛ́ a raas.<verse eid="JHN 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Imi mi taas kazatse ncɛɛt weshek. Imi mi tees banet izen dot narɔ iya Adakunom ntong, nɛ na narɔ inyis baYahuda, vit ikyɛng fi imi ra ni nɛt. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Akyɛ fi i sak i di nye mo irisim ɛ? Rip banet fɛ́ ba mi foos kucɛɛt hom, nɛ ba da tak. Iba rēn ikyɛng fi in mi ka ba taas.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Ni izen fɛ́ aYeso fɛrɛng anɔng, azining ayɛt bafi itosok karɔ iya mben e, fɛ́ a se ni nyeseng azɔng, a rus aYeso, ama fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Anɔng fi ngɔn da cɛɛt ne agbat àware ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Ki in mi nye kucɛɛt kukak kumaan e, ni di tonong kabak inɛn e. Ki kucɛɛt fi in fɛ̀ yet atsak, akyɛ sak fi i di rus ɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Anas sak ne ba tseng ni wu ni rosom, sak ashon aKayafas agbat àware.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nanan aBitrus ifɛ́ afaa, nɛ ifɛ́ ataat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Ne aSiman Bitrus mo ni nyeseng narɔ ifok kurong. Bakak ayɛt banet e, fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn yet azining ayɛt bafi imɛɛs anet yɔng awɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:25">A tɛ ton wu ye, &lt;&lt;Awey yo! Imi di se awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Azining ayɛt basam agbat àware me, fɛ́ ayet afi izit anet yɔng fɛ́ aBitrus kin ku tɛmɛng kuto, fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Ayet ngɔn wu fi in kin da di, ni igɔɔt gung ni wu awɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />ABitrus tɛ a bang ya nanan, kpaf ni izen e yɔng, atsanyon kpa tɛp.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso ashon aBilatus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Bop nadiding, ba wuruk ne aYeso ari aKayafas sak i tse ni wu ne agbis aGwɔmna aRoma. BaYahuda me raba dan nɔ ne agbis e ice ba, ye nek fok ba shim ba won ice ba jɛrɛ, nɔng ba bin se ba di ya nayak iyiring ne amok aPasova. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Nek anɔng, aBilatus wuruk amatse, a ka ba se, a ka ba rip, &lt;&lt;Iyin te yin kukun anet yong naton akyɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Ba fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Kɛ anet yɔng fɛ́ a yet afi inɛn awo, kɛ vit ikyɛng fi i sak in ku kɔk yit sak ashon ngɔn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />ABilatus fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;Tseng yin ni wu, i da tsi i ku ra yin ishɔt ikyɛng yin, kuri ifi ntsi yin.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:31">Awɛt baYahuda me fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Vit iyit ne agap itsɛɛt ishɔt iku.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Ikyɛng deng te anɔng, nɔng aYeso bin ku kpaf ti fi iwu kin fɛ̀ a bi ku.<verse eid="JHN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />ABilatus tɛ bun ayɛt agbis e, a yes aYeso, a ku nye ku rip ye, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn wu fi i yet agwɔm baYahuda me yɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Irip e yeng, yet ifi ice ngɔn na, ke i yet iyɔng fɛ́ ba fɛ̀ ni di rip ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />ABilatus fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;A da se ti imi yet afɛ́ aYahuda me akak ɛ? In fɛ̀ kɛ ayet banet ngɔn, nɛ agbat àware fɛ́ ba da kɔk sak ashon in awɛ. Di tak, akyɛ de fi ira yɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />AYeso fɛ̀ ye, &lt;&lt;Igwɔm inaan yet ifɛ́ azatse kang awo. Kɛ igwɔm inaan fi i yet ifɛ̀ azatse kang, kɛ bafi ikuus hom tsot itsom, nɔng ba bin rone baYahuda ba di tekap. Awey, igwɔm in yet ifɛ́ azatse awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />ABilatus tɛ fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;A sot ngɔn yet agwɔm a?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:37">AYeso fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn tak gyat, nek imi yet agwɔm. Ikyɛng fi isak ba di tes mo dɔng, nek anɔng fi isak, in di bɛ́ azatse, nɔng in da bin taas atsak. Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ ayet afɛ́ atsak, di foos.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />ABilatus fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Akyɛ de i yet atsak ɛ?&gt;&gt; Ama kucɛɛt e, aBilatus tɛ wuruk sak amatse, sak narɔ baYahuda me, a fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;Da imi se anet yong, ni inɛn ikikak fi ishɔt da ku ya mo awo. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Ngma ne anɔng, iyin bɛ̀ yin, nggɔn yin, fɛ́ ki izen amok aPasova nye, ni in ki tun yin, afi inyang azining. Kɛ, iyin shim yin, in ki tun yin &lt;agwɔm baYahuda,&gt; yɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Ba ta nkun ye, &lt;&lt;Awey, iyit shim yit awo! Ki tun yit aBarabas ningya!&gt;&gt; (ABarabas e, kin yet akpatang.)<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="s">Ba Tsɛɛt aYeso Ishɔt <optbreak /> Iku Itegak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Ama anɔng, aBilatus sok aYeso, a fɛ̀, ne ba ku tsot ne ahwyereng. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Batsom e, bat abong igwɔm afi itsitsan, ba ku te ne ni ice. Ba tɛ ba ku te, kugboo kukpin kukak kugyigyel. <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />Ba woso tsees narɔ wu, ne ba nye ni wu, &lt;&lt;Kutset agwɔm baYahuda ni ku sot kusɔɔp!&gt;&gt; Ne ba ma ku rus kufok.<verse eid="JHN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />ABilatus tɛ a wuruk sak amatse, a tse a fɛ̀ ne baYahuda me, &lt;&lt;Fok yin, imi yɔng, in da ki tun yin, aYeso me, in shim, ni i rēn yin, fok da imi ku se ni inɛn ikikak fi ishɔt da ku ya mo awo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Izen fɛ́ aYeso wuruk, ne abong itsitsan e ni ice wu, ni kugbat ikpin kusɔp, kugyigyel e, ni irɔm wu. ABilatus fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;Di yin anet e yo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Ni izen fɛ́ àware, nɛ bafi itosok karɔ iya mben e ku di, ba ta nkun ye, &lt;&lt;Ne ba tekak iwu! Ne ba tekak iwu!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:6">ABilatus fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Tseng yin ni iwu, ikyɛng yin, a da tsi i ku tekak yin ni mbɔk yin. Nek imi, ku se ni inɛn ikikak fi ishɔt da ku ya mo awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />BaYahuda me, fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Iyit bɛ̀ yit ntsi yit, ntsi me tonong, fok i se gbing-gbing ne a ku, nek a kok ice wu, fok iwu yet nggon Adakunom.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Izen fɛ́ aBilatus fok kucɛɛt e yɔng, inyim ban ku yit. <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />A tɛ bun sak ayɛt agbis e, a rip aYeso ye, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn yet anet akɛ?&gt;&gt; Awɛt aYeso te yuu, dan fɛ̀ ikikak. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Nek anɔng, aBilatus fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn rangɔn dan cɛɛt ni imi yɛ? Ngɔn rēn fok, imi bi ice, fi in da sak ba da bisik, ke ni in te, ba da tekak awɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn bi ice ikikak naton hom awo, tit nek Adakunom wu, fɛ́ a mi da nɔɔk ide naton min, nek anɔng, ayɔng fɛ́ a di nabak ni bɔk ngɔn, iwu fɛ́ a da wat ni inɛn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Nkum fɛ́ aBilatus fok anɔng, a kpa tsɛt irèn, fɛ́ a di ki hwyet ne aYeso, awɛt baYahuda, ya kashon ni itang nkun ne ba nye, &lt;&lt;Ki ngɔn hwyet ne anet yong, idɔng tonong fok, ngɔn yet afidang aKaisar agwɔm aRoma awo. Nek ngma anet fɛ́ a yes ice wu agwɔm, a tsin tsɛt icuna ne aKaisar.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Izen fɛ́ aBilatus fok anɔng, a wuruk ne aYeso sak amatse, a tse a sonong ni kuta isonong ishɔt wu, fɛ́ ba yes iko, karɔ fɛ́ ba bas ne ata. Ba yes ni ilem baYahuda ye, aGabata. <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Kunom e yɔng, kin yet kunom inye nkyɔrɔk nfi izen amok aPasova gyam. Izen e kin se bakat, ka tɛ inom.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:14">ABilatus fɛ̀ ne baYahuda me, &lt;&lt;Nga yin agwɔm yin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Ba kpa tang nkun ye, &lt;&lt;Tseng yin ni iwu, tsi fɛt yin iwu! Tsi tekak yin iwu ni kum!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">ABilatus fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;I shim, itekak yin, agwɔm yin ɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Agbat àware me fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Iyit bɛ̀ yit agwɔm azizining kyɛk, ayet aKaisar agwɔm aRoma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />ABilatus ma ka ba nabak aYeso ne ba tse ba tekak.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 19:16">Itekak e</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Nek anɔng, batsom e tseng ne aYeso. <verse eid="JHN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />AYeso wuruk ni iwɔp e, a mi fanang kukum itekak wu, sak narɔ fɛ́ ba yes ika, karɔ akup ice banet. Ba yes ika ni ilem baYahuda ye aGolgota. <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Azɔng fɛ́ ba tse, ba ku tekak mo, nɛ banet bakak bafaa, azining ni bɔk iyak wu, akak ni bɔk imen wu, aYeso nate ba.<figure style="fig" alt="Jesus crucified" file="WA03926b.tif" size="col" loc="JHN 19:18" copy="Wade Images" ref="19:16-18">Ba tekak aYeso</figure><verse eid="JHN 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />ABilatus te ne ba jɛk, ikyɛng fi i sak ba ku tekak mo. Ikyɛng fɛ́ a jɛk yet, &lt;&lt;AYeso anet aNazaret, agwɔm baYahuda.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />BaYahuda dot fa ijɛk e, nek karɔ fɛ́ ba di tekak aYeso me kin se bakat ni kuwɔp, ba kin jɛk ijɛk e ni ilem baYahuda, aLatin, aGirik. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Agbat àware baYahuda me fɛ̀ ne aBilatus ye, &lt;&lt;I bi jɛk ye, &lt;Agwɔm baYahuda awo,&gt; jɛk ye, &lt;Anet yong nye a fɛ̀ fok, iwu yet agwɔm baYahuda.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />ABilatus fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Ikyɛng fi in mi jɛk, ide de fi in mi jɛk.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Ama fɛ́ batsom e, mi gang itekak aYeso, ba sok nkpin wu, ba kaba ina nasa na naas, kaangan ba ne kasa kafuu. Ba tɛ ba sok kukpin wu kufe ayɛt e, fi ku se vit itos, fɛ́ ba bat iko gbol sak aben.<verse eid="JHN 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Ba fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;In bi sarak yit iko awo, won in di barak yit icang ni ko, in da di yit angan wu a da ya iko e.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:24">Ikyɛng deng te anɔng, nɔng ba bin di shining ikyɛng fɛ́ ba ki mang jɛk ni fumung aJɛrɛ ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">&lt;&lt;Ba kabasa nkpin in nate ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 19:24">nɛ ba di bara icang</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 19:24">ni kukpin ayɛt hom,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">nɔng ba bin di,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 19:24">ayɔng fɛ́ a da ya iko.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">Ikyɛng e deng fɛ́ batsom e kin nye dɔng.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Banet fɛ́ ba se ni nyeseng bakat ni kukum itekak aYeso me ba kin yet, nggɔ wu, nɛ banganyining nggɔ wu; aMarya abin aKilopas, nɛ aMarya afɛ́ aMagadala. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Izen fɛ́ aYeso di nggɔ wu, nɛ afi-imɛɛs wu yɔng, fi iwu shim ni nyeseng bakat azɔng, a fɛ̀ ni nggɔ wu, &lt;&lt;Aneng, di nggon ngɔn ka&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />A ma fɛ̀ ne afi-imɛɛs wu me, &lt;&lt;Di nggɔ ngɔn yo.&gt;&gt; Nkum atuk e yɔng sak ashon, afi-imɛɛs e wat a tseng ni iwu sak ari wu.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iku aYeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Ama anɔng, ne aYeso mi rēn fok kutomong wu mi gang, a fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Iyɛ ingash di daam.&gt;&gt; A fɛ̀ anɔng, nɔng ikyɛng fɛ́ ba ki mang jɛk ni fumung aJɛrɛ di shining. <verse eid="JHN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Ashi ajatang akak kin se ni ite tsik azɔng, ni wang, ba bɔ ina ni ikyɛng ikak fi ise fungam, ba tubuk ina nikon ahisop, ba ku te ne na nu. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Ama fɛ́ aYeso bamang ashi me, a fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Ba mi gang!&gt;&gt; Ama anɔng, a te gup ice wu, a kɔrɔk nsong wu.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Kunom e yɔng kin yet, kunom inye nkyɔrɔk gyam nek Atuk aSabat. Nek nggɔn baYahuda, da in shim nkom ni in irēn resek mo na akum itekak sak atuk aSabat awo. ATisa aSabat yet agbat inom, nek anɔng wu fɛ́ a sak bakɔk-ashon baYahuda tsɛt aBilatus a ka ba nɔɔk irèn, ne ba se ba di bushung atak banet e, nɔng ba se ba di tisik ni nkom e. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Nek anɔng wu fɛ́ batsom e, tse ba di bushung atak anet afi imɛsɛng e, nɛ afɛ́ afaa me. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Awɛt ni izen fɛ́ ba ta narɔ aYeso, ba bushung atak wu awo, nek ba di a mi tsang ku. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Tit, atsom azining fɛ́ a tubuk ku kufam aYeso ni kukɔn, karɔ me wat ka kpa teng nasok nɛ ashi.<verse eid="JHN 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Anet yong fɛ́ a kin di ikyɛng e deng, iwu fɛ́ a tak ifɛ̀ me, ifɛ̀ wu me yet atsak, iwu rēn fok kucɛɛt e yet atsak, nek anɔng fɛ́ a tsin ki taas yin mo, nɔng iyin da bin di nɔɔk yin atsak ba. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Ikyɛng deng te anɔng, nɔng ikyɛng fɛ́ ba ki mang jɛk ni fumung aJɛrɛ, i se i di shining ye: &lt;&lt;Vit kukup wu kukak fɛ́ ba but.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Tɛ fɛ́ ba jɛk narɔ kakak ni fumung aJɛrɛ ye, &lt;&lt;Ba bi di, ayɔng fɛ́ ba ku tubuk.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kunɛt aYeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Ama anɔng, aYusufu afi iwɔp Arimatiya, fɛ́ a yet afi ikuus aYeso afi inɛt, nek a foos inyim bakɔk-ashon baYahuda, a tse ra awon ne aBilatus, ye ne a ku nɔɔk irèn i sok kukom aYeso, nɛ a tse a nɛt. Abilatus ku nɔɔk irèn, a tse sok iko, a tseng ni iko. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />ANikodimos, anet yɔng fɛ́ a kin tse narɔ aYeso ne tuk, a tseng gung nɛ aYusufu, aNikodimos kin bereng nkpe ikan nfi nkɔn ntek, fɛ́ ba nye ina ne amur, nɛ alos, kudot na kin se bakat ibit a shining. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Iba bafaa ba sok kukom aYeso, ba sok nkpe ikan nfi nkɔn ntek nɛ nkpin alinɛn nkan, ba di kunung kukom e, ba nye kpaf ti nggɔn ba nfi baYahuda di se. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Narɔ fɛ́ ba di tekak aYeso me, igɔɔt ikak se azɔng. Azɔng ni igɔɔt e yɔng, kurɛk kukak kufas se azɔng, fɛ́ da ba ki mang di nɛt akak awo. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Nek kunom e kin yet kunom inye nkyɔrɔk gyam nek aPasova baYahuda, nek kurɛk e se bakat fɛ́ ba di nɛt aYeso azɔng.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s">Kurɛk e se vit anet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Ne bop adiding afi kunom imɛsɛng afi inyim nnom, ne karɔ irēn resek hwyi, aMarya afɛ́ aMagadala, a tse ni irɛk e, a tse a se ba mi yirik kuta fɛ́ ba di fam kanu irɛk e. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Nek anɔng, a ta i tsi sak narɔ aSiman Bitrus, nɛ afi-imɛɛs e yɔng fɛ́ aYeso di ti iyɛ, a fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Ba mi tse ba sok kukom aTisa me ni rɛk e, iyit da in rēn yit, karɔ fɛ́ ba tse ba di sak iko awo.&gt;&gt; <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus raised from the dead" file="WA03930b.tif" size="col" loc="JHN 20:2" copy="Wade Images" ref="20:1-2">AYeso donong ni irɛk</figure><verse eid="JHN 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Nek anɔng, aBitrus, nɛ afi-imɛɛs e yɔng ba yit irèn sak ni rɛk e. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Ngma ba bafaa, ba sok itsi, awɛt afi-imɛɛs e yɔng teng a wat aBitrus, a tung tse a ta ni rɛk e. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />A te nyuk, a te gang kayɛt irɛk e, a di nkpin alinɛn e azɔng, da a ne a nɔ ayɛt e awo. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Ama anɔng, aSiman Bitrus, ne a bɛ́ a ta ama, iwu tin nɔ ayɛt irɛk e. A di nkpin alinɛn azɔng aben. <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />A tɛ di ares inɛt e yɔng fɛ́ ba kin di karam ni ice aYeso. Ares e di se mo kpaf tɛ ba kin di kunung kukom, anɔng narɔ na, zɛɛt ne afɛ́ alinɛn me. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Afi-imɛɛs azining e yɔng, fɛ́ a tun tse a ta ni irɛk e, da ne a nɔ ayɛt e awo. A di, a di nɔɔk atsak. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />(Sak izen e yɔng, iba resek dan rēn ikyɛng fɛ́ ba jɛk ni kufumung aJɛrɛ ye, kukom wu ba ti kudorok.)<verse eid="JHN 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso tonong ice wu <optbreak /> sak ne aMarya afɛ́ aMagadala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Ama anɔng, bafi imɛɛs e bun sak ari. <verse eid="JHN 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />AMarya di weseng azɔng nanu irɛk e, a woso ának. A se ne kanak e, a te nyuk, a te gang ka yɛɛt irɛk e, <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />a fɛ́ di batomaza bafaa, fɛ́ ba te nkpin nkan. Ba sonong narɔ fɛ́ ba kin di mees kukom aYeso me, azining abace, azining abatin.<verse eid="JHN 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Batomaza fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Anyin asa, i tos akyɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:13">A fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Ba mi sok aTisa min sak akɛ yi, imi da in rēn karɔ fɛ́ ba tse ba ku sak mo awo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Ama anɔng, a fɛ́ a tirik, a di aYeso ni nyeseng azɔng, iwu vit irēn fok aYeso yɔng.<verse eid="JHN 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Anyin asa, akyɛ sak fi i tos ɛ? Angan wu fi itsɛt ɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:15">AMarya yes gyang anet itomong igɔɔt e yɔng. Nek anɔng, a fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Akɔk-ashon, ki ngɔn wu fi i sok kukom e, ni di tak karɔ me, nɔng in di tsin sok iko.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;AMarya.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:16">A tirik, a ku di, a fɛ̀ ni wu ni ilem baYahuda, &lt;&lt;ARaba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iyerek deng nyeseng naton: Anet itees.</char></note>!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;I bi di tɛnɛng awo, nek imi resek dan ngarak sak narɔ Ada min. Ngɔn tsi se baruneng, da fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;In mi yɔng in bun sak narɔ Ada min, nɛ Ada yin, in bun sak narɔ Adakunom min, nɛ Adakunom yin ba.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />AMarya afɛ́ aMagadala tseng, a tse tak bafi imɛɛs e ye, &lt;&lt;Imi mi di aTisa yit!&gt;&gt; A ma ka ba tak ikyɛng fɛ́, a fɛ̀ ni wu.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso tonong ice wu <optbreak /> sak ne bafi imɛɛs wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Ne hwyɛ afi kunom imɛsɛng inyim nnom e, bafi imɛɛs aYeso kana tusung ari kakak, ba famasa natitu nek inyim bakɔk-ashon baYahuda. Ayet anɔng, aYeso bɛ́ a nyeseng ne te ba, a ka ba te show, ye, &lt;&lt;Won yin iyɛ yin ni men!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Ama fɛ́ a fɛrɛng anɔng, a ka ba tonong mbɔk wu, nɛ akufam wu. Izen fɛ́ bafi imɛɛs wu ku di, ba nye iyɛ ikan makiyi.<verse eid="JHN 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />AYeso tɛ fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Won yin iyɛ yin ni men! Kyon ti Ada min di tom, anɔng fi imi tsin ki tom yin ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Ama fɛ́ a fɛrɛng anɔng, a ka ba fɛp ni nsong wu, a fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;Shan yin Kabik aJɛrɛ. <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Ngma ayɔng fi i ku fuut yin inɛn wu, Adakunom mi ku fuut e; ngma ayɔng fi da i ku fuut yin inɛn wu awo, Adakunom mi ku fuut e awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso tonong ice wu sak ne aToma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />AToma (fɛ́ ba ku yes aDidimus), azining ayɛt bafi imɛɛs wu kusɔk abe afaa me, iwu kin se wereng ni izen fɛ́ aYeso a kin tse se ishɛrɛp bafi imɛɛs e.<verse eid="JHN 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Ishɛrɛp bafi imɛɛs e fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Iyit mi di yit aTisa me!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:25">AToma fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Ki da imi di imya, narɔ fɛ́ atsɔm kin ku taas mo mbɔk awo, ki da in di te itsambɔk yin, ayɛt ábóng nfot fɛ́ atsɔm e kin di nɔɔs awo, in di tes mbɔk ne akufam wu awo, in mi tsin di nɔɔk atsak ni ifɛ̀ awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Ama nkɔs nkara, bafi imɛɛs wu tɛ ba nyim ari me yɔng, aToma kin se gung ni iba. Natitu kin se ni ifam, aYeso bɛ́ a nyeseng ne te ba, a ka ba te show ye, &lt;&lt;Won yin iyɛ yin ni men!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />A da ma fɛ̀ ne aToma, &lt;&lt;Te itsambɔk ngɔn aze, di mbɔk hom, nabak mbɔk ngɔn di basap akufam hom. Won avit inɔɔk atsak, da shan atsak.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />AToma fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;ATisa min, nɛ Adakunom min!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />AYeso ma fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn nɔɔk atsak, nek ngɔn di di ne ayisi yɛ? Awɛng se naton bayɔng fɛ́ ba di nɔɔk atsak, dan ne ba di.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />AYeso raas ntomong abes dot ashon bafi imɛɛs wu, fɛ́ da ba kyem ba jɛk ina ngma ni fumung kang awo. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Ba jɛk nkyɔrɔk nang ngma, nɔng iyin bin di nɔɔk yin atsak fok aYeso wu a yet Anet-Isheshek, Arim Adakunom. Ba jɛk anɔng, nɔng i di ki se yin kutset, ki i nɔɔk in atsak, ayɛt iyerek wu.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s">AYeso nɛ ízos abes fɛ́ ba yisik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Ama anɔng, aYeso bang tɛ tonong ice wu, sak ne bafi imɛɛs wu, ni ice ibanang izek aTibariyas. Ikyɛng e kin se ane: <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />ASiman aBitrus, nɛ aToma (fɛ́ ba ku yes aDidimus), nɛ aNataniyel fɛ́ a ne na aKana afi mben aGalili, ni nnon aZebedi nafaa, nɛ bafi imɛɛs aYeso bakak bafaa, ba kin se gung azɔng. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />ASiman aBitrus fɛ̀ ni iba, &lt;&lt;Imi yɔng in tsin yisik ízos,&gt;&gt; Wat ishɛrɛp bafi imɛɛs e fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Iyit da tse yit ngma ni ngɔn.&gt;&gt; Ba wuruk, ba tse ba nɔ ayɛt kukyɛ ashi, wat katuk e yɔng kusum, ba yit ikikak awo.<verse eid="JHN 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Ne bop adiding, aYeso bɛ́ a nyeseng ni ibanang. Bafi imɛɛs wu vit irēn fok iwu yɔng.<verse eid="JHN 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />AYeso ka ba rip ye, &lt;&lt;Bacam, i mi kyem iyit yin ízos ikak ɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:5">Ba fɛ̀ ni iwu, &lt;&lt;Awey yo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;Ta yin agunung yin abak kubɔk iyak kukyɛ ashi me, i da yit yin ide.&gt;&gt; Nek anɔng, ba ta agunung ba kpaf te aYeso di fɛ̀, ba bɔ ízos dot makiyi, ba kyem ba kɔrɔk agunung e awo, nek kunanang.<verse eid="JHN 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Wat afi-imɛɛs e yɔng, fɛ́ aYeso di te iyɛ ni wu, a fɛ̀ ne aBitrus, &lt;&lt;Ye aTisa yit yɔng!&gt;&gt; Izen fɛ́ aSiman Bitrus fok fɛ́ a fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Ye aTisa yit yɔng,&gt;&gt; a sok kukpin wu a te iko, nek a kin tsang tun iko, a wat a furuk sak ayɛt ashi. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Ishɛrɛp bafi imɛɛs e, ku kuus mo sak ayɛt kukyɛ ashi me, nɛ ba kɔk agunung e, ni ízos ngmef. Nek kuyikyik ba kin se bakat atak anakat ataat sak ni ice ibanang. <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Izen fɛ́ ba mi wuruk sak ni ice ibanang, ba di ica irong, ni ízos naton e, nɛ akpam.<verse eid="JHN 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;Bɛ́ yin ni ízos ikak, ayɛt idɔng fi i tsin meseng yit yin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Wat aSiman Bitrus tse a ngarak kukyɛ ashi me, a ka ba se mo ikɔrɔk agunung ízos e sak amatse. Agbat azós fɛ́ a se ayɛt agunung e, se anakat azining ni nsɔk ntoon, ni ide itaat (153). Ngma ni kudot de, agunung e sarak awo. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni ba, &lt;&lt;Bɛ́ te yin awɛng.&gt;&gt; Vit akak ayɛt bafi imɛɛs wu me, fɛ́ a kyem a bi iyɛ a ku rip, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn yet angan ɛ?&gt;&gt; Nek iba rēn fok a aTisa yɔng. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />AYeso tse a sok akpam e, a ka ba nɔɔk, a tɛ sok ízos e, a ka ba nɔɔk. <verse eid="JHN 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Izen iyeng yet ifɛ́ ataat, fɛ́ aYeso tonong ice wu, sak ne bafi imɛɛs wu, ama fɛ́ ba mi dorok kukom wu.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso tɛ kɔrɔk nhwyɛ aBitrus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Ama fɛ́ ba mi gang iya kuyak, aYeso fɛ̀ ne aSiman Bitrus, &lt;&lt;ASiman, arim aYohana, ne atsak ngɔn di shim iwat ba ba yɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">ABitrus fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Ey, aTisa ngɔn rēn, fok imi da shim.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">AYeso fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Yɛrɛ naban ítsamang hom.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />AYeso tɛ ban ku rip, irip ifɛ́ afaa, &lt;&lt;ASiman, arim aYohana, ne atsak ngɔn di shim ɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">ABitrus fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Ey, aTisa ngɔn rēn fok imi da shim.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">AYeso fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Tot ítsamang hom.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />A tɛ bang ku rip, irip ifɛ́ ataat, &lt;&lt;ASiman, arim aYohana, ngɔn di shim ɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Iyɛ aBitrus beseng, nek aYeso ku rip, a te kataat ye, &lt;&lt;Ngɔn di shim ɛ?&gt;&gt; ABitrus fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;ATisa, ngɔn rēn kaakyi ikyɛng; ngɔn rēn fok imi da shim.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">AYeso fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Yɛrɛ nabin ítsamang hom. <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Won in da tak atsak, ni izen fi ngɔn kin yet acam, ngɔn ma ni tes ares ikyɛng ngɔn, ni tsees kaakɛ fi i shim; Wat ama fi, i bi kop, i bi nabak mbɔk ngɔn, nɛ kak da tes ares, nɛ tsees ni ngɔn narɔ fi i shim.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />AYeso fɛ̀ anɔng, nek a di tonong kuri iku fɛ́ aBitrus bi ku, fi i bi bɛ́ ni iratek sak ne Adakunom. Ama ifɛ̀ me dɔng, aYeso fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Di kuus mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />ABitrus tirik, a di afi-imɛɛs e yɔng, fɛ́ aYeso di te iyɛ ni wu, a tsin ka ba kuus mo. (Iwu me yɔng, fɛ́ a kin di te yendeng, ni agwɔm aYeso, ni izen fɛ́ ba kin tsin ya kuyak atuk, fɛ́ a kin rip aYeso ye, &lt;&lt;ATisa, angan wu fɛ́ a da ka rɛp ɛ?&gt;&gt;) <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Ni izen fɛ́ aBitrus ku di, a rip aYeso, &lt;&lt;ATisa, a yo anɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />AYeso fɛ̀ ni wu, &lt;&lt;Ki imi shim ne di wey ni kutset, sak izen fi in bi tin di bun, kudaam ngɔn yet akyɛ? Ifɔɔn yet di kuus mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JHN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Nek anɔng, ifɛ̀ me teng i tseng ayɛt bafi ikuus aYeso fok, afi-imɛɛs yɔng bi ku awo. Da kucɛɛt fɛ́ aYeso fɛ̀ yet fok da a bi ku awo; ikyɛng fɛ́ a fɛ̀ yet, &lt;&lt;Ki imi shim, ne di wey ni kutset sak izen fi in bi tin di bun, kudaam ngɔn yet akyɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Afi-imɛɛs e yɔng, wu fɛ́ a tsin taas nkyɔrɔk e nang, fɛ́ a tɛ, a te iko ni ijɛk. Iyit rēn yit fok kucɛɛt wu yet atsak.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Nkyɔrɔk di se dot fɛ́ aYeso kin nye. Ki ba kin fɛ́ ba jɛk ina ngma ni nzizining, imi di te ke ngma kazatse, bɛ̀ kawat fɛ́ ka di ki sok afumung e awo.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>